<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">Danpiehnina</book>
  <para style="h">Danpiehnina</para>
  <para style="toc1">Danpiehnina</para>
  <para style="toc2">Danpiehnina</para>
  <para style="mt">Danpiehnina</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam thute Jordan suolampang, gamdai, Paran leh Tophel, Laban Hazeroth leh Dizahab kikaal a Suph gal a Arabah a, Mosi in Israel mite zousie kunga agen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Horeb akipat in Kadesh-barnea tan Seir muol lam zuiin ni sawm leh khat lam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh kum sawmlina, ha sawm leh khatna khum ha, ni khat niin hichi ahing hia, Mangpa’n amauh kunga hil dinga thupieh akunga apieh zousie dungzuiin Mosi in Israel tate kungah agenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Heshbon a teng Amormite leengpa Sihon leh Edrei a Ashtaroth a teng Bashan leengpa Og atha nua in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jordan suolam Moab gam ah tami dan agen panta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mangpa i Pasian un Horeb muol ah ahing houpi a, tami taangah na um sawt sengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kihei unlen kipandoh ta un, tualeh Amormite taanggamte leh akimvel a Arabah phaijang leh taang te ah, phaigamte, simlamte leh tuipi pangte ah, tuipi leh Euphrates luipi tan in pei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai un gam khu na masang uah a um hi. Lut unlen, Mangpa’n na pu leh pate uh Abraham, Isaak leh Jakob kunga ama u’leh a nua ua, ahahasuonte kunga pieh achiem gam khu luo ta un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tualeh khumhun laiin na kung uah keima ngen in ka hing paw zou sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un noute ahing pung sah a, ngaivawi un, tuin na tamdan uh van a aasite bang na hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa na pule pate uh Pasian in ahing thu chiem bangin, tu sangin ale tul tampi in hing pung sah henlen hing guolzawl ta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangchi’n keima ngenin, na buoinate uh, na puohgihte u’leh na kiheh tuonate uh ka po zou diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na phung lah ua mipil, theisiem mi, adan ding thei mi teldoh unlen, amaute na lah ua vaihawm dingin ka bawl ding hi, chiin ka gen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh nouten ka bawl ding ua na sil gente a hoi hi, chiin na hing dawng ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n na phung lah ua, lamkai mipilte leh adan ding theite kala a, na tung ua vaihawm thunei dingin ka bawl hi, tul tunga lamkaite, za tunga lamkaite; sawmnga tunga lamkaite, sawm tunga lamkaite in leh na phung lah ua lamkaite toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh khum hun laiin na vaihawmte uh thu ka pie a na unaute uh kaal a thubuoi ngaikhie unlen, unau leh unau tualeh gamdangmi akung ua umte kikaal thu dihtahin vaihawmpieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaihawmna ah mi deisah tuom na nei ding uh ahisih, milien leh mineu kibangtahin na ngaikhietpieh ding uh ahi, koima na giin ding uh ahisih hi, vaihawmna khu Pasian a ahizieh in. Tualeh nou a ding a thu hasa taluote ka kungah hing tut zel unlen, tuachi’n keiman ka ngaikhe zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh khum hunlai in sil na bawl ding zousie uah thu ka hing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Tualeh Mangpa i Pasian un thu ahing pieh bangin Horeb a kipat in ipawt kheta ua, Amormite tang gam lampi a, gamdai lienpi leh zauhuoi na mu ukhu tawnsuohin ipeita ua, Kadesh barnea mun ihing tungta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Keima’n na kung uah, Mangpa i Pasian un ahing pieh Amormite tang gamte na hing tungta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngai un, Mangpa na Pasian un gam ahing pe zouta hi, Peitou unlen Mangpa napu leh pate uh Pasian in na kung ua agen bangin va luo ta un, zau sih unlen, lung zong lung kesih un, ka hing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh ka kungah na bawn un, na hing pei chiet ua, agam umdan va enkhie a, ipei touna ding lampi leh ilutna ding khopi tanchin hing hil ding mi imasang ah sawl vai na chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuabanga na ngaituona un ahing kipah sah mama a, tuachi’n na lah ua pat mi sawm leh ni, phung khat apat mi khat zel kala a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amaute a kuon ua, taangte ah apeitou ua, tualeh Eshkol phaijang ahing tung ua, gam ava enkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh amauten tua gam a theigate alou ua, ikung uah ahing posuh ua, tualeh Mangpa i Pasian un ahing pieh gam khu gam hoitah ahi chi thu ahing tut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Hinanleh na peitou ut sih ua, Mangpa na Pasian uh thupieh kaal in na helta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na puon innte uah na phun ua, Mangpa’n ahing muda ziehin suhmang ding a, Amormite khuta piehlut dinga, Izipt gam a kipata ahing puidoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hei sungah ipeitou thei diei? i unaute un, “Agam mite khu eite sangin a lienzaw ua, asang zaw uhi, akhopite uh alien a, van sun in kulbang anei uhi; tualeh Anakim tate khum mun ah ka mu uh chiin ahing lung kesah uhi na chi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Keima’n na kung uah amaute ging sih unlen, zau zong zau sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh na masang ua peipan, na mit mu uah nou ding a, Izipt gam a abawl zousie bangin ahing doupieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh mi’n gamdai a, ata apuoh banga, Mangpa na Pasian un na peina lam zousie ua, tammun na hing tun masangsie ua ahing puoh dan na mu uhi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hinanleh tuachi pumpum in zong, Mangpa na Pasian uh, na gingta tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na puon inn zah na ding uh sui pieh ding leh na peina lampi uh kawhmu dinga zan a meikuong leh sun a meipi a nou hing puipa khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Tualeh Mangpa’n na thu gente uh a za a, a lungthah a, akichiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tam khang giloute lah a mi khat in zong, napu leh pate uh kunga, pieh dinga ka chiem gam hoi khu na mu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jephuneh tapa Kaleb chilou ngal in, ama’n vang amu dinga, tualeh ama kung leh atapate kungah a kenga ava tot gam ka pe ding hi, azieh pen aman Mangpa azui bukim hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Noute ziehin kei tungah zong Mangpa a lungthah a, nang zong khum gam ah na lut sih ding ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hinanleh nang hing panpipa Nun tapa Joshua pen a lut ding hi, ama hanthawn in, aman Israel tate khum gam aluo sah ding ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh na taneute uh, gallah in ahing kilah pieh ding hi, na chite uh leh tunia sie leh pha thei nailou na tate uh tua gam ah a lut ding uhi, akung uah ka pe ding a, amauten aluo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hinanleh noute pen kihei unlen, Tuipi san lam gamdai ah pei un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Tuachi’n nouten ka kungah, Mangpa tungah kana khielta uhi; Mangpa i Pasian hing thupieh bangin ka peitou ding ua kava dou ding uhi, chiin na hing dawng uhi. Tualeh michin na bawn ua galvan a na kivon chiet zou un, taanga kaltou dingin na kisa zouta ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka kungah, peitou sih unlen dou zong dou se da mai un, azieh pen na lah uah ka um sih hi: tuachilouin na melmate un ahing zou ding uhi, chi’n akung uah gen in ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuachi’n na kung uah thu ka gen a, nouten na ngaikhe sih ua, hinanleh Mangpa thupieh kalin na helta ua, kisathei tahin taangah na kaltou teitei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum taanga teng Amormite noute dou dingin ahing pawtdoh ua, khuoi in mi adel bangin noute ahing del ua, Seir ah Hormah tan dongin ahing na that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tualeh na hing kile kia ua, Mangpa maiah na kapta ua, hinanleh Mangpa’n na aw uh angaikhe ut sih a, abil zong ahing daw ut tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum muna na um sung uh dungzuiin Kadesh ah nitampi na um ta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tuachi’n ikihei ua, Mangpa’n ka kunga agen bangin Tuipi san lam ah gamdai ah ilutta ua, tualeh Seir taang khu ni tampi ivel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ahing houpi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tam muol na vel sawt sengta uhi, mallam zuon in kihei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh mipite khu, Seir tanga teng, Esau hahlesuon na unaute uh gam sung kantan a pei ding na hi ua, amauten nou a hing na giing ding ua, tuaziehin pilvang dingin mipite thu pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaute kidoupi sih un, azieh pen agam uh kengphang chie khat zong noute ka hing pe sih ding hi, aziehpen Seir tang khu Esau luo dinga ka piehsa ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na neh ding uh a ann u’zong sum in na lei ding ua, tualeh na dawn ding uh a tuite u’zong sum in na lei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un, na khut nasep zousie uah ahing guolzawl zel ding hi, Aman tam gamdai lienpi na palsuoh dan u’zong athei hi. Tam kum sawmli sung Mangpa na Pasian un ahing umpi zing a, bangma tahsap na nei sih uhi, chiin thu pie in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elath leh Ezion-geber akipat in Arabah lamlienpi a peiin Seir taanga teng i unau Esau hahlesuonte gam itot peisuoh zou un, “I kihei ua Moab gamdai lampi ah i peita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n ka kungah “Moabte subuoi sih unlen, gal in zong kidoupi sih un, aziehpen agam uh noute luo dingin ka hing pesih ding hi. Lot hahlesuonte kungah Ar atan ding ua ka pieh tah zieh in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Masanglaiin tuamun ah Anakimte banga milien leh tam leh sang pipi Emimte ana teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua mite khu Anakimte banga miliente a sim ahi ua, hinanleh Moab miten Emimte achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Masanglaiin Hormite zong Seir ah ana teng ua, hinanleh Mangpa’n apieh gam sunga Israel taten abawl mabangun, Esau taten aluokhum uhi; athat ua agam uh aluo pieh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuin thou unlen, Zered luita kan un, kachi a, tuachi’n Zered luita ikanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kadesh-Barnea apat i hing pawt khie ua, Zered luita ikaan ua, Mangpa’n akung ua akichiem banga, mipite lah apat galkap mite khang zousie abeisieng tandong khu kum sawm thum leh giet ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaute a bawn ua giehphuol a mipite lah akipat ashi gam masangsie un, amaute sumangthai dingin, Mangpa khut atung uah atuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tuachi’n hichi ahing hi a, tuabanga galkap thei mi zousie a manthai ua, ashi sieng nua un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa’n ahing houpi a, ka kungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuni’n Moab gam Ar na tot peisuoh ding ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Ammon mite gamgi zul nailam na hing tun chiengin, amaute subuoi sinlen, ha u’zong kihaupi sin, aziehpen Ammon mite gam beh khat zong noute ka hing pesih ding hi, Lot hahlesuonte kunga atenna ding ua ka piehsa ahi tahzieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />(Tua gam zong Rephaim gam banga sim a hi, masanglaiin Rephaim mite ana teng ua; Ammon miten amaute khu Zamzum mite a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anakimte banga milien pipi leh atam a tam tualeh sang pipi ahi ua, hinanleh Mangpa’n amasang uah amaute asumanga, tualeh amauten adeldoh ua, amun uah akitenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Seir muol a um Esau hahlesuonte ding a, Hormite a suhmangthai pieh lai a, abawl bangin; tuachi’n amauten aluo ua, amun uah tuni dongin ateng denta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Gaza tandonga khoneu nounou a na teng Avimte khu Kaphtor akipat a hing pawtdoh kaphtor miten a sumang ua, amunte uah ateng ta uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thou unlen kipandoh un, tualeh Arnon lui kan un; Ngai un, na khut uah Heshbon leengpa, Amormi Sihon leh agam na khut ah kahing peta hi; luo panta unlen, galin kidoupi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuni in nangma giinna leh nangma zauna vannuoi pumpi a um namte tungah ka koi pan dinga, amauten na tanchin aza ding ua, achitun ding uhi; tualeh nangma ziehin lunggim in a um ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tualeh Kedemoth gamdai akipat in Heshbon leengpa Sihon kungah lemna thupuo mi ka sawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na gam sungah hing pei suoh sah in, lamlien zuiin ka pei ding a, zietlam ahiei, veilam ahiei ah zong ka piel sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka neh ding ann sumin nang leisah dinga, ka dawn ding tui zong sum in nang lei sah ding hi, keng in hing pei suoh sah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jordan ka galkai a, Mangpa ka Pasian un ahing pieh gam ka lut masangsie a (Seir muol a teng Esau hahlesuonte leh Ar a teng Moab miten ka tunga abawl bang un) kachi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh Heshbon leengpa Sihon in agam a hing tawn sah ut sih a, aziehpen Mangpa na Pasian un tunia na mu mabangun, na khut ua ahing pieh khiet thei na dingin alungsim akhausah a, alungtang a paupeng sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n ka kungah Ngaiin, Sihon leh agam na masangah ka hing peta hi; agam na tan theina dingin luo panta in ahing chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Sihon leh amite zousie eite dou dingin Jahaz ah ahing kuonta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa i Pasian un amau khu ei kungah ahing pe khie a, a ma leh atate leh a mite zousie ithat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khum hun laiin akhopite zousie ila ua, khum khopite a, pasal leh numei zousie leh naupang zousie ithat gam ua, khat zong ikhawi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />I khopi lahte apat a, gallah sil a ilah vante leh gantate eima dingin ikilah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Arnon lui gei a um Aroer a kipat leh lui guom a um khopi akipat Gelead tandongin, eite dou dinga hattaluo khopi khat zong a um sih hi, Mangpa i Pasian un ahing pekhe siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ammon mite gamah bou na hing lut sih ua, Jabbok luipang zousie a gamte leh taanggam a khopite leh Mangpa i Pasian un ahing phallouna poumate toh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tuachi’n i kihei ua, Bashan lampi ah i peitou ua, tualeh Bashan leengpa Og khu amite zousie toh, eite doudingin ahing kuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n ka kungah, Ama giing sin, ama leh amite zousie leh agam na khut a ka hing pieh tahziehin; Heshbon a teng Ammon mite leengpa Sihon tunga na bawl bangin ama tungah zong na bawl ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa i Pasian un, Bashan leengpa Og zong amite zousie toh i khut ah ahing pekheta a, tuachi’n khat beeh zong hingkhawilou in i that siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khum hunlai in Bashan a Og leenggam a, Argob gam kai sunga khopi sawmguh umte zousie a abawn in ilah pieh sieng ua, ilah piehlou khopi khat zong a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tam khopite zousie kulpi baang sang tahtah te kulkotpite leh kotpite kalna nei ngen ahi ua, kul bang neilou khopi neu tamtah simlou in zong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Hebron leengpa Sihon tunga ibawl bangun, khopi chin a Pasal leh numei leh naupangte a unpi un i that sieng ua, i suchimit siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh ganta zousie leh khopi sungte a van um zousie eima dingin galvan lah in ikilahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh khum hunlai in Amormite leeng nite khut akipat in Arnon lui apat Hermon taang dongin, Jordan gal tamlang panga um gam ila uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hermon khu Sidon miten Sirion achi ua, Amormiten Senir achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Phaijanga khopi zousie, Gelead gam zousie, Bashan gam zousie, toh, Bashan gam a Og leenggam khopite Salekah leh Edrei tan adongin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen miliente lah a adam sun khu Bashan leengpa Og ngentang ahi. Ngaivawi, alupna khu sia a kibawl ahia, tam lupna khu Rabbah a, Ammon mite lupna mama khu ahisih amah? Mihing tonga tein adunglam tong kuo, availam tongli ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tualeh khum hunlaia, iluo uh tam gam, Arnon lui kunga um Aroer akipat Gelead taanggam kimkhat leh tuana um khopite khu Reuben mite leh Gad mite kungah ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Gelead gam um nalai teng leh Bashan gam zousie khu Og leenggam ahia, Manasseh nam kimkhatte kungah ka pie hi; Argob gamkai zousie leh miliente gam achi uh Bashan gam zousie toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh manasseh tapa Jair in Argob gam zousie, Geshurmite leh Maakath mite gamgi tandongin ala a, tuni tandongin ama min puoin Bashanhavoth-Jair akichi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Gelead gam khu Makir ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Reuben mite leh Gad mite kungah Gelead apat Arnon lui tan, phaijang kim khat leh Ammon mite gamgi Jabbok lui tandong gamgi ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh phaijang zong Jordan leh akai gamte, Kinnereth apat Arabah tuipi lien (chituipi) suolam panga Pisgah nuoi muolpang ken tandongin kana pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tualeh khum hunlai in noute thu ka hing pie a, Mangpa na Pasian un tam gam na luo ding un, ahing peta hi; na unaute uh Israelte masangah, galkuon thei zousie nava galkai ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh na zite u’leh na taneute uh tualeh na gantate uh (ganta na hau mama uh chi ka thei ngal a) ka hing piehsa khopite ah ana um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa’n nouma banga na unaute uh galmuonga akhawldam sah masangsie leh Mangpa na Pasian un Jordan gal a amaute gam apieh ding aluo masangsie un: Tuazou chiengin nouma ka hing gampieh na luona uah na hing kile kia ding uhi, chiin thu ka hing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh khum hunlai in Joshua thu ka pie a, tam leeng nite tunga, Mangpa na Pasian uh sil bawl zousie na mit ngel in na mu siengta hi. Tuachibangma in Mangpa’n na valuo ding uh gam zousie tungah abawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaute na giin ding uh ahi sih, Mangpa na Pasian un, nou a dinga ahing doupieh ding zieh in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tualeh khum hunlai in, keiman Mangpa kungah ka ngen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw Mangpa Pasian, na suohpa kungah na thupidan leh na khut thahat dan na musah pan ta hi; aziehpen Nang banga, tambang sil bawlthei leh hattah lei leh van ah pasien koi a um ei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hing galkai sah inlen, Jordan lui gal gam nuom leh singtang gam hoi leh kilawm leh Lebanon hing musah in, chiin ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh noute ziehin Mangpa ka tungah alungthahta a, tuachi’n ka ngetna asang ta sih a, tualeh Mangpa’n ka kungah hunsah ta’n, tam thute ah hing houpi nawn sin, achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pisgah muolvum ah kaltou inlen, suolam leh tumlam, tualeh simlam leh mallam ngain, kihei inlen na mitin en in, aziehpen Jordan lui na galkai nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh Joshua thu pie inlen, hanthawn inlen suhat in, aziehpen ama mipite masangah agalkai dinga, nava mu ding gam amaute aluo sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Beth-Peor gal a phaijang ah i umta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Khaile, Israelte aw, tuin na hintheina ding u’leh, na pu leh pate uh Pasian in ahing piehsa gam a na lut ua na luo theina ding ua, vaihawmna dan ka hing hilte leh thupiehte ngai khie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh thupieh, ka hing piehte, na zui theina dingun, ka hing thupiehte na belap ding uh ahi sih a, na lahkiem ding u zong ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Baal-peor zieha Mangpa silbawlte na mit ngel un na muta ua, Baal-peor bie mi zousie, Mangpa na Pasian un na lah ua kipat a sumang siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh noute Mangpa na Pasian uh dettah a pom zousie tuni tandongin hing leh damin na um nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai un, Mangpa ka Pasian hing thupieh bangin na luo ding uh gam a na lut chieng ua na zuizel dingun dan piehte leh vaihawmna dan thupiehte kahing hilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin pilvang tahin nit unlen zui un, aziehpen tuami khu, nam dangte mitmu a, na pilna u’leh na theisiemna uh hivan in, amaun tam thupiehte zousie aza ding ua, tam nam thupitah, piltah leh sil theisiem tah ahi ngut ma uhi, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen ihat pouma chienga Mangpa i Pasian in ahing nai banga, amauh nai zel pasien nei nam thupi koi a um ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh tunia na masang ua ka koi danthupieh zousiete, vaihawmna dan, dihtahte, bang nei nam thupi a um amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Bangteng hileh pilvang mai unlen, pilvangtahin kikem phot mai un, tuachilouin na mit ua na silmusa zousie uh na manghil kha ding ua, na damsung un na lungtang ua kipat apawtmang kha ding hi; hinanleh na tate u’leh na tate uh tate hilzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Adiehdiehin Horeb muola Mangpa na Pasian uh masanga na din ua, Mangpa’n ka kung a mipite hing hankhawm inlen, leitung a adam sung ua, Keima giindan azil theina ding u’leh atate uh ahil theina dingun, ka thute ka theisah ding hi achi ni na manghil kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n na hing kikhawm ua muol nuoiah na hing ding ua, vanlaizawlhol in muol khu mielnate, meipite, miel keikuinate umsah in muol khu a kata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n meilum lah a kipat in na kung uah thu agen a, awging naza ua, hinanleh alim leh mel bangma na mu sih ua; awging maimai na za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Athuhun na zui ding ua, noute ahing thupieh; thu sawmpieh na kung uah ahing phuongdoh a, tuate suongpeh ni tungah a giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khumhun laiin, luodinga nava galkaina gam ua na tun chieng ua na zui ding uh thupiehte leh vaihawmna dante nouma hing hil dingin thu ahing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tuaziehin kipilvang mai un, Horeb muol a mei lah a kipat a Mangpa’n noute ahing houpi niin, alim leh mel bangma na mu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khuchilouin nouma siemthu anu ahiei, apa ahiei lim leh melpuo, milim khengin na ki suse ding uh ahi sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leitunga um gamsa kibahpi ahiei, vanlaizawl a leeng aha nei vate kibahpi ahiei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Leitunga bohvah ganhingte kibahpi lim bang ahiei, leinuoi a tui sunga nga lim leh mel puo na bawl thu ua, na bieh lou na dingun pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh vanlam nga a, na ettou chieng ua, ni leh ha leh aasite leh van a um zousie na mu chiengun, Mangpa na Pasian un, van sin nuoi a, mi zousie ding a, aguot piehte’n ahing hip a, na bieh ua, ana naseplou na dingun pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n noute pen tunia na hi bang ua, amite leh agoutante hi dingin, Izipt gam sia haltuina mei a kipat ahing puidoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuathamlouin noute ziehin Mangpa ka tungah alungthahta a, Jordan gal ka kailou na ding leh, Mangpa na Pasian un na goutan ding ua ahing pieh tua gam hoi sunga ka lutlou na dingin akichiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin, keipen tami gam sungah ka shi ngei dinga, Jordan gal kailou ding ka hita, hinanleh noute pen na galkai ding ua, tua gam hoi khu na luo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pilvangun khuchilouin Mangpa na Pasian un nou leh Ama kikaal a athuhun bawl na manghil kha ding ua, milim khenthu ahiei, ahisihleh Mangpa na Pasian un ahing phalpieh vawtlou sil bang ahiei kibahpi limte na ki bawl kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa na Pasian ukhu mikahtum hat meikuong bang leh thangsiet hat Pasian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tate leh tute na hing nei ua, gam sunga hun sawtpi, na tehsiet dong uh na hing um nua chieng un, na hing kisuhsiet ua, milim kikhenthu, sil khat kibahpi lim, khat poupou na bawl ua, Mangpa na Pasian uh sulungthah dinga, amitmu a silgilou na bawl u’leh vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jordan galkai a, na valuo ding uh gam akipat na mangthai pai ding uh, chi na tungtang thu uh theipitu dingin tunin lei leh van ka han ahi; na tengsawt sih ding ua, hinanleh huoisetah a suhmang in na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n nam zousie lah ah ahing thethang dinga, Mangpa’n ahing delzahna namte lah ah tawmnou khat na pha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khunah mihing siemthu sing leh suonga kibawl khomu theilou, khoza theilou, bangma ne theilou leh gimnam zong theilou pasiente nna nasemta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh khum gamsung ma a, Mangpa na Pasian uh na sui ua, na lungtang zousie u’leh, na hinna zousie utoh na sui u’leh, na mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Genthei thuoh a na um chieng u’leh, ni nukhia chienga tam silte na tung ua, ahing tun chiengin, Mangpa na Pasian uh kunglam ah na hing kihei ding ua, athu na mangta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />(Mangpa na Pasian u khu khotuo siem Pasian ahi ngal a.) Aman ahing taisan sih dinga, ahing sumang sih ding hi. Tualeh na pu leh pate uh kunga akichiemna thuhun amanghil sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Noute um masang, tumasanglai a hun umsate sui unlen, leitunga Pasian in mihing asiem chiila kipat, van mongkhat akipat lelamtawp tandong ngaituo un, tambanga sil thupi bang ahiei a um ngai tai mah ahisihleh hichibang akiza ngai ta ei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ngai un, Meikuong lah a kipata Pasian aw na zah ua, na hin nahlai bangun mi’n Pasian aw za in ahing ngai uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahisihleh Mangpa na Pasian un, noute dinga Izipt gam a abawl banga, Pasian in ze etnate a, chiemte nate a sillamdangte a, kidounate a, khut hat a, banzahte a, tualeh silchizathuoite a, nam dang lah a kipat nam khat puidohna a um kha ngai ta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mangpa khu Pasian ahia, Ama loungal adang a um sih chi na theina dingun tam silte khu na kung ua ahing kimusah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Thu ahing hil theina dingin, van a kipat in aw ahing zasah a, leitungah ameikuong thupitah ahing musah hi, tualeh meikuong lah a pat athu gente naza uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh Aman napu leh pate uh a it ziehin, anua ua hing um ding, ahahasuonte uh ateldoh a, Izipt gam a kipat in asilbawltheina hattahin, Ama ngel umpina toh ahing puidohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nam dang nang sanga thupi zaw leh hatzawte notdoh ding leh tunia na hibang ua, hing puilut a agam uh na luoding ua hing pe dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuni’n thei unlen, na lungtang uah vom un, tunglam van ah leh nuoilam lei ah, Mangpa khu Pasian ahi chi thei un, adang mawngmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaziehin kumtawn a dinga, Mangpa na Pasian un, nou ahing pieh gam a, nouma leh na hah na suonte uh hoina ding leh na damsawt theina dingun, adante leh athupiehte, tua ka hing piehte khu, na zui ding uh ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Jordan gal nisuohna lampang ah, kihumbitna dingin khopi thum a sepkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tupna neilou leh tumasanga zong kimudana neilou, a inn vengte that khate tailut theina dingin; tam khopite khat poupou a tailut in akihumbit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Khumte khu Reuben mite adingin gamdai muolvumjanga um Bezer khopi a guot pieh a, Gadmite a dingin Gelead gamsunga um Ramoth khopi a guot pieh a, tualeh Manasseh mite a dingin Bashan gamsung a um Golan khopi a guotpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tualeh tam khu Mosi in Israel tate kunga a dan pieh khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tamte khu Izipt gam a kipata ahing pawtdoh nua ua, Mosi in Israel tate kunga agen theipina thupieh leh vaihawmna dan thute khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jordan suolam gal Beth-peor toh kigalsai phaijang a, Izipt gam a kipata ahing pawtdoh nua ua, Mosi leh Israel taten atha uh Heshbon a teng Amormite leengpa Sihon gam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ama gam leh Bashan leengpa Og gam, Jordan gal ni suona lam a Amormite leeng nite gam aluo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Arnon lui panga Aroer akipat Hermon kichi Sion tang tandongin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jordan gal suolam pang phaijang zousie, Pisgah muol hap nuoi suh Arabah tuipi dongin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in Israel tate zousie ahankhawm a akung uah, “Aw Israel Ngai un, na zil ua, na zui ua, tualeh na bawl dingun tunia na zah ua ka gen thupiehte leh vaihawmna dan thute ngaikhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa i Pasian un Horeb muol ah thuhun ahing bawlpi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa’n tam thuhun khu ipu leh pate uh ana bawlpi sih a, hinanleh eite tunia dam a um zousiete toh abawl zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa’n muol tungah meikuong lah apat noute toh kimaituoin thu agen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khum hun laiin, Mangpa thu noute kunga hing phuong dingin, kei khu Mangpa leh noute kaal ah ka ding a, meikuong ziehin na zau ua, muol ah na kaltou sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Kei Mangpa na Pasian uh, Izipt gam a na saltanna inn ua pat a hing puidohpa khu ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka masangah Keima loungal pasien dang na nei dinguh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Milim khenthu tunglam van a um ahiei, nuoi lam lei a um ahiei, lei nuoilam tui sunga um bang ahiei kibahpi sil mawng mawng na bawl ding ahi sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuate bie a amasanga na kunding ahi sih a, ana uh zong naseppieh ding ahi sih, “Kei Mangpa na Pasian khu thangsiet hat Pasian Ka hia, Pate gitlouna zieh a, tate gawt zel, ahing mudate tunga, khangthum, khangli tandonga, gawtna tut zelpa leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei hing it a, ka thupiehte zui mi sang tampite kunga khotuona langsahpa Pasian ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian min amawhin na lou ding ahi sih hi; Mangpa’n Ama min amawh a loute khu siemmaw tangsah lou a akoilou ding ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian in thu ahing pieh bangin khawlni siengthou sah ngitnget dingin tangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nasep ding zousie uh ni guh sungin na sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh ni sagi ni khu Mangpa na Pasian khawlni ahi, tua niin nna mawngmawng nasep ding ahisih; nang leh na tapa in zong, na tanu in zong, na suohpa in zong, na suohnu in zong, na bawngtal in zong, na sabiltung in zong na ganta khatpou in zong na innhuong sunga um gamdang mi in zong, nna asep lou ding uh ahi, nangma banga na suohpa leh na suohnu zong akhawlding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh nang zong Izipt gam ah sila nava hita a, Mangpa na Pasian in khuna kipat in khut hattah leh banzahin ahing puidoh hi chi thei zingin, tuaziehin Mangpa na Pasian in khawlni tang dingin thu ahing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian in thu ahing pieh bangin nanu leh napa zatat in, tuachi’n Mangpa’n gam ahing piehna mun ah, na lawching dinga, na damsawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tuol na that ding ahi sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Aang na kawm ding ahi sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Na guh ding ahi sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Na innvengte tungah theipitu dihloua napan ding ahi sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Na innvengpa zi na deigaw ding ahi sih a, Na innvengpa inn ahiei lou ahiei, asuohpa ahiei, asuohnu ahiei, abawngtal ahiei, a sabiltung ahiei, ahisihleh na innvengpa neilelam mawngmawng ahiei zong deigawna lungsim na nei ding ahi sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tam thute Mangpa’n muoltunga meikuongte, meilumte leh mielna huoisetah lah a pat, aw ngaitahin na bawn ua kikhawmte kungah agenta a, abelap nawn tuom sih hi. Tualeh tuate khu Aman suongpeh ni tungah a giel a, keima ahing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, muol khu meikuong thupitahin akah laiin, miel lah a pat a a aw na zah lai un, na namlah ua lamkai leh upate ka kunglam nai in na hing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Ngaiin, Mangpa i Pasian in i kung uah athupi dan leh alet dan ahing kilang sahta a, tualeh meikuong lah a pat a aw iza ta ua, Pasian in mihing ahoupi in zong shina ahituon loudan tuni’n ithei ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin bangdinga shi ding ihi uoi? Tam meikuong thupitahin ahing katum ngei ding hi. Mangpa i Pasian aw izah kia u’leh vang i shita valon ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Meikuong lah a pata Pasian hing aw izah bang ua za a, hing ngal tahsa nei zousie lah ah koi a um ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nangman Akung va nai inlen, Mangpa i Pasian in agen ding zousie va ngai khe vawiin, tualeh Mangpa i Pasian in na kunga agen zousie, nangman koute kungah nang gen sawn ding a, tuachi’n kana ngaikhe ding ua, ka zui ding uh, na chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tualeh nang houpi lai ua, na thu gen uh Mangpa’n ana za a; tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka kungah, Tam mipiten na kunga thu agen uh kana za a athu gen zousie uh a gen dih mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw, tambang lungsim paw den uleh keima, giindan ahing siem ding ua, ka thupieh azui ngitnget ding ua, ama u’leh atate uh kumtawnin alawching mama ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A kung uah pei inlen, “Na puon innte uah nua pei kia ta un,” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh nang pen, tanah ka kungah ding inlen, aluo ding ua ka pieh gam a, abawl theina ding ua, a kung ua na hilding thupiehte, danthute leh vaihawm thukhenna dante zousie, na kungah ka hing gen ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa na Pasian un thu ahing pieh zousie zui dingin na pilvang ding ua, zietlam ahiei, veilam ahiei ah na piel sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na valuo ding uh gam a na hin theina ding u’leh, na hoi theina ding u’leh, na damsung nite uh a sawttheina dingin, Mangpa na Pasian un ahing thupieh lampi zousie na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tualeh tamte khu nava luoding uh gam a, nava galkai chieng ua, na zui ding ua, Mangpa na Pasian un, noute hildinga thu ahing pieh, thupiehte leh vaihawmna dante ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nouma leh na tapate u’leh na tupate un Mangpa na Pasian uh zaudan na siem ua, na kung ua ka hing pieh athupiehte leh adan thute na dam sung ua na zuina ding u’leh na dam sung nite uh asawt na dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin Aw Israel, napu leh pate uh Mangpa Pasian in ahing chiemsa, nawitui leh khuoizu luonna gam a, na hoina ding u’leh, nasataha na hing pun theina dingun, Ngaikhie unlen pilvang tahin zuiun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Aw Israel ngaikhie un, Mangpa i Pasian ukhu Mangpa khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian khu na lungtang zousie, na hinna zousie leh na hatna zousie a, na it ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh tam thu, tunia ka hing thupieh, na lungtang uah vom ngitnget un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na tate uh phatuomngaitahin na zil sah ding ua, na innsunga na tou chieng bangin, lampi a na pei chieng bangin, na lup chieng bangin, tualeh na thaw chieng in zong na hil zel ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh chiemtena dingin, na ban uah na viel ding ua, na mittegel kaal uah, talpang gahna bangin na nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh na inn kotbiengte u’leh na kotpi khuomte uah na giel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, Mangpa na Pasian un napu leh pate uh, Abraham, Isaak leh Jakob te kunga pieh dinga a chiem gam a, na bawl u’zong hi lou khopi thupi tah leh hoi tahtahte leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na suhdim uh hi vawtlou silhoi adim innte leh na tawdoh uh hilou tuikhuh tawsate leh na suon khah u’zong hilou grep huonte leh Olive singte umna a ahing puilut a, nieng leh tai a na neh ua, na tai tah chiengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pilvangun, tuachilouin Izipt gam a na saltanna inn ua pat a nou hing puidohpa Mangpa na Pasian uh na manghil kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian u khu na giing ding ua, ama nna nasem ding ua, Ama min louin na kichiem kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasien dangte, na kimvel ua um namte pasiente na bieh ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na lah ua um Mangpa na Pasian uh thangsiet hat Pasian ahi, khuchilouin Mangpa na Pasian lungthahna, na tung uah hing kuongdoh kha vanin, leitunga pat ahing sumang kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Massah a na ze et bang ua, Mangpa na Pasian uh na ze et ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un ahingpieh thupiehte, a theipina thute tualeh athugousiete pilvang tahin na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa mitmu a dih leh hoi na bawl ding uh ahi; Nang dinga na hoina ding leh Mangpa’n napu leh pate uh kunga achiem gam hoi lut a na luo theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mangpa’n a gensa banga, na masang ua kipat na melmate zousie uh delmang dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tualeh hun hing tung dingte a, na tate un Mangpa i Pasian uh hing thupieh theipina thute leh thupiehte leh vaihawmna danthute bang china ahiei? chia ahing doh chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na tapate uh kungah, Izipt gam a Pharaoh sal in kana taang ua, Mangpa’n khut hattah in Izipt a kipat ahing puidoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n ka mitmu un Izipt gam tung leh Pharaoh leh a innkuonpite tungah, chiemtenate leh sil lamdang thupi tahte leh chizat huoite ahing musah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n eite pen ipu leh pate kunga ana chiemsa gam khu pe dinga ahing puilut theina dingin, khuna kipat in ahing puikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh tam dan thupiehte zousie zui ding leh i hoi tawntung na dingin, Mangpa i Pasian zaudan siem dingin Mangpa’n thu ahing pie a, tuni a banga ang hingkhawi theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman thu ahing pieh banga, Mangpa i Pasian masanga athupieh zousie zui dinga ipilvang u’leh idihtatna uh ahi ding hi, chiin na chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Msngpa na Pasian un, na luoding gam ua, a hing puilut chieng a, na masang ua nam tamtah, Hitmite, Girgashmite, Amormite, Kanaanmite, Perizmite, Hivmite tualeh Jebusmite, noute sanga lienzaw leh hatzaw nam sagite anawdoh hun chiengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian un, amaute, noute kunga ahing pieh a, na thagam hun chieng un, amaute khen nei louin na thatgam siengding ua, amaute toh thuhun na bawl ding uh ahi sih hi; na hepi ding u’zong ahi vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amaute toh zi leh ta a, na kiten vawtlou ding uh ahi, na tanute u’zong atapate utoh na kitensah ding uh ahisih a, tualeh na tapate uh zi dinga atanute uh na lah vawt lou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen na tapate keima hing zuilaite, pasien dangte biehna lam ah apuikawi kha ding uhi; tuachi’n Mangpa lungthahna khu na tung uah mei bangin a kuong dinga, thakhat in a hing sumang kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahivang in atung uah hichi bangin na bawl zaw ding uhi, amaitamte uh na suhsiet pieh ding ua, a suong milimte uh na satguoi pieh ding ua, singa kibawl a pasien limte uh na haltum pieh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Noute Mangpa na Pasian ua dingin, nam siengthou na hi uhi. Mangpa na Pasian un leitunga nam zousiete lah a Ama a tuom hidinga ahing tel tuom na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Namdangte sanga na tamzawh zieh ua, Mangpa’n a itna na tung ua atunsah leh ahing tel na hi sih uhi; nam zousie lah a tawmpen nahi bou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n noute ahing it zieh leh napu leh pate uh kunga ana kichiemna tangtun sah a ut ziehin, na saltanna inn uh Izipt leengpa Pharaoh khut a pat in, khut hattahin ahing puidoh a, ahing tankheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa na Pasian ukhu, Pasian ahi chi thei un, Pasian muonhuoi, Ama it a, a thupieh zui mite tunga, khang tul tandonga athuhun leh a khotuona, koi zing ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama mudate sumang dinga, amaitanga thuhpai zel ahi, Ama mudate tungah azekai sih dinga; amai tang ah a thuh kia pai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin tunia bawl dinga ka hing pieh thupiehte leh thugousiete leh vaihawmna dan thute na zui ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tuaziehin hichi ahing hi dinga, tam vaihawmna thute na ngaikhiet ua, na zui ua, tualeh na bawl ua ahileh, Mangpa na Pasian un, napu leh pate u’kunga, akichiemna thuhun leh khotuona na tung uah azui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Aman noute ahing it dinga, ahing guolzawl dinga, tualeh ahing pungsah ding hi. Napu leh pate uh kunga pieh dinga akichiemna gam ah, na gil ua ga leh na gam gate u’zong a guolzawl nalai ding a, na bute uh, na zute uh, na sathaute uh, na bawng noute u’leh na belam noute u’zong a guolzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nam zousie tungah guolzawl na hi ding ua, noute lah leh na gan honte lah uah, atal leh anu, a chiing mawngmawng a um sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mangpa’n nou akipat natna hii zousie athengsah sieng dinga, na theisa uh Izipt gam natna hiite, na tung uah atusah sih dinga, nou hing mudate tung ah akoi zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian un ahing piehkhiet ding namte zousie, na suhmang sieng ding uh ahi, na hepi ding uh ahi sih a, apasiente uh nna zong nasep ding uh ahi sih hi, aziehpen noute ding a thang ahi ding ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Na lungsim ua, tam namte ei sangin atam zaw ua, bang ichi deldoh zou diei, na chi u’leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaute na giinlou ding uh ahi. Mangpa na Pasian un Pharaoh leh Izipt mite zousie tunga asilbawlte thei zing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ze-etna thupitah na mit mama ua na mute uh, chiemtenate, sillamdangte, khut hattahte leh banzahte a Mangpa na Pasian un, noute ahing puikhiet dante; tuabangmain Mangpa na Pasian un, na mi giinte uh tungah abawl zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaban ah Mangpa na Pasian un, adam nalai na lah ua kipata kibudapte amanthai masangsie un alah uah tunpi asawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaute na giin ding uh ahi sih hi; Mangpa na Pasian uh, Pasian hat leh chizat huoi na lah ua a um ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un, tua namte na masang ua kipat awl awl in ahing deldoh pieh ding a, thakhat thu in na sumang pai ding uh ahisih, tuachilouin gamsate na tung uah ahing pung kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa na Pasian un amaute na khut uah ahing pekhe dinga, amanthai masangsie un buoina nasatah atung uah atung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh aleengpate uh na khut uah ahing pekhe dinga, amin uh vannuoi akipat in na phietmang masangsie un, na masang uah koima ading ngam sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A milim pasien khenthute u’zong meiin na haltum ding ua, tam milimte atuomna uh dangka leh sanate na deigaw ding uh ahi sih a, lah zong na lah vawt lou ding uh ahi; khuchilouin thang ah na awh kha ding uhi. Mangpa na Pasian ua dingin sil kidahhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na innsung uah sil kidahhuoi na hing puohlut lou ding uh ahi, khuchilouin tua silte bangin hamsiet in na um kha ding uhi, tuate khu na huot ua, na kidah mama ding uh ahi. Aziehpen tuate khu hamse thuoh sil ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Chidam lu dam a na um ua na hing pun sem sem ua, noute hing pieh dinga, napu leh pate uh kunga Mangpa’n akichiemna gam nava luo theina ding un, tunia ka hing thupiehte zousie zuiding in na pilvang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh athupiehte na zui ding uoi, nazuisih ding uoi, chi na lungsim uh theina dinga ze et ding leh hing kingaingiem sah dinga, gamdai a kum sawmli sung ahing puina lampi zousie thei zing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh mihing tanghou guohin ahing sih ding a, hinanleh, Mangpa kam a pat a pawt thu chintengin mihing ahing zaw ding hi chi ahing theisah theina dingin, Aman ahing sungiem a, gilkiel na thuoh uh ahing phal pieh hi. Tualeh na thei ngailou uh napu napate un zong athei ngailou uh, manna in ahing vah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh tam kum sawmli sung na satung ua, na nihten napuonsilte uh ase tuom sih a, na kengte u’zong a pawm sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh mi’n ata aphawhhil zel bangin, Mangpa na Pasian un, ahing phawhhil zel ahi chi, na lungtang un thei zingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuazieh in alampite zuiding a, Ama zaudan siem dingin, Mangpa na Pasian uh thupiehte na zui ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un, muol leh guomte a kipata hing luong luituite, tuikhuhte leh tuinahte umna gam hoi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tualeh mangbute, barli bute leh grepte leh theipite tualeh kawlbutheite leh Olive thaute leh khuoizu tamna gam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tasam loua tanghou na nehna ding uh gam ah ahing puilut ta hi, tam sungah bangma tahsap na nei sih ding ua, tualeh agama suongte sia ahia, a muol leh taangte sum-eng laikhieh theina gam hoi mama ah ahing puilut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh na neh ua, na tai mama hun chiengun, gam hoi mama ahing pieh ziehin, Mangpa na Pasian uh na phat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tunia thu ka hing pieh, athupiehte leh avaihawmna dan thute leh adanthupiehte, zuilou dinga, Mangpa na Pasian manghillou dingin pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuchilouin vang na neh ua, natai ua, inn hoitahte na lam ua, na ten chiengun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh na ganhonte u’leh na belamte uh ahing pun a, na dangkate leh na sanate uh ahing pun a, na nei nalam zousie uh ahing pun chiengin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na lungtang ahing kiliensah dinga, Izipt gam a na saltanna ua kipat a nou hing puidoh Mangpa na Pasian uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />gamdai lienpi leh zauhuoi gulngan leh mom ai tamna, tui umlouna leh dangtahna gam a hing puipa, tualeh meisa suonga kipata tui pawtdoh sahpa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nouma suhngiemna ding leh tu nua chienga, na hoina ding ua, hing etkhiehna dinga, napu leh pate thei ngailou manna a gamdai a, noute hing vahpa na manghil kha ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tualeh na lungtang ua, ka silbawltheina leh ka khut hatna zieh a, tam sumlepai hausatnate ka nei ahi na chi kha ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa na Pasian uh na thei zing ding uh ahi. Tunia abawl banga napu leh pate uh kunga athuchiem asuhdet theina dinga, hausatna na mu theina ding ua, hatna hing pepa khu Ama ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi ding a, Mangpa na Pasian uh na manghil pouma ua, pasien dangte na zui ua, ana naseppieh ua, na bieh pouma u’leh pellou in na mangthai teitei ding uhi chi na tungthu uah tuni’n khautahin ka hing hil ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na masang ua Mangpa’n asuhmang namte bangin, Mangpa na Pasian uh thu na manlou ziehun na mangthai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Aw Israelte Ngaivawi un, Nou sanga thupi zaw leh hatzaw namte, vanzih hol a khopi kulpibang nei leh thupi tahtahte luo dinga tunia Jordan galkai ding na hita ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi lien leh sang Anakim hahlesuonte, na theisa u’leh na zah sa uh, miten Anak tate masangah koi a ding ngam diei? a na chi uh na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin na masang ua pei, Mangpa na Pasian uh mei katumhat bang ahi chi tunin thei un. Aman amaute asumang dinga, ahing suhngiem pieh dinga, tuachi’n Mangpa’n na kung ua, agensa bangin amaute na deldoh ding ua, na sumang pai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian un, amaute na masang ua kipat ahing deldoh pieh nua chiengin, na lungtang un idihtat zieh ua tam gam luo dinga, Mangpa’n ahing puilut ahi, chiin ngaituo vawt sih un. Tami namte khu agitlou zieh ua, Mangpa’n ahing deldoh pieh, ahizaw bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na dihtat zieh uh ahiei, ahisihleh na lungtang dih zieh uh ahiei in, agam uh na luo sih ding ua, hinanleh tam namte agitlouna zieh ua, Mangpa na Pasian un, napu leh pate uh Abraham, Isaak leh Jakob te kunga, ana chiemsa asuhtangtung theina dinga amaute anawdoh ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Mangpa na Pasian un tam gam hoi khu na dihtatna zieh ua, na luoding ua ahing pieh ahi sih chi theisiem un; nam paupeng tah na hi bou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gamdaia Mangpa na Pasian uh, na lungthah sah dante uh theizing unlen manghil sih un. Izipt gam a kipat a na hing pawtdoh ua kipat, tam mun na hing tun dongun Mangpa tungah na hel ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Horeb ah zong, Mangpa na sulungthah ua, tuachi’n noute sumang nuom khop in Mangpa na tung uah a thangpai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suongpeh, Mangpa na Pasian un na kung ua thuhun ahunna suongpeh la dinga muol a ka kaltou laiin ni sawmli leh zan sawmli muol tungah kava uma, ann lah ka ne sih a tui zong ka dawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka kungah Pasian khutzunga kigiel suongpeh ni ahing pie a, khummun a na kikhop lai ua, mei kuong lah a pat a, Mangpa’n na kung ua athu gen zousie bangin tuate tungah akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh ni sawmli leh zan sawmli bei nua in hichi ahing hi a, Mangpa’n suongpeh ni thuhun suongpehte ngel a hing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka kungah, thou inlen, tam mun a kipat peisuh mengin, aziehpen Izipt gam a kipat a na puidoh na mite akisusegawp siengta uhi; azuiding ua ka thupieh lampite a kipat in kintahin apielmang paita uhi, milim sunthu akibawl ta uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tuabanah, Mangpa’n ka kungah, Ngaivawi, tam mite ka et leh mi genhapi ahi uhi, chiin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaute sumang ding leh Vannuoi apat amin uh phietmang dingin ka law law ka law mai ding, tualeh nangma akipat amaute sanga hatzaw leh thupizaw nam khat ka siemzaw maiding, chiin ahing houpi nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka kihei a, muol a kipat ka hing kumsuh a tualeh muol khu mei in akata a, thuhunna suongpeh nite ka khut lang niin ka tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh ka en a Ngaivawi, Mangpa na Pasian tung uah sil na bawl khielta ua, bawngnou lim sunthu na kibawlta uhi; Mangpa’n thu ahing pieh lampi akipat in na piel mang zuaita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n suongpeh nite ka domtou a, ka khut lang ni apat ka pai a, na mitmu uah ka sepkeh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh tumasanga ka bawl bangin, ni sawmli leh zan sawmli, Mangpa masangah ka bohkhupa, Mangpa sulungthah dinga amitmu a, giloutah a na bawl uh na khelnate zousie uh ziehin ann lah kane sih a tui zong ka dawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen noute sumang dinga Mangpa lungthahna, athangpaina leh alungkimlouna chizat huoi khu ka giinga, Hinanleh tuahun laiin zong Mangpa’n ka thugen a ngaikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa khu Aaron sumang nuom khopin athangpai mama a, hinanleh ken Aaron a ding in zong khumhun mama in ka nget pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh na khelna zieh ua na bawl uh bawngnou lim khu ka la a, mei ah ka hal a, ka satguoi a, leivui banga nel in kagawt guoi a, tualeh a vuinel khu muol a kipat a hing luongsuh lui ah ka paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tualeh Taberah leh Masaah ah tualeh Kibroth-hattava ah zong Mangpa na sulungthah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuabangmain Mangpa’n, peitou unlen, ka hing gam pieh va luo un chia, Kadesh barnea apat ahing sawllai in, Mangpa na Pasian uh thupieh kal in na kiphin san ua, a aw zong na ngaikhe sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka hing theichil nia kipat in, Mangpa tunga hel hat mi na hi ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tuachi’n Mangpa’n noute ka sumang ding ahing chi ziehin Mangpa masangah ka khupboh a, ni sawmli leh zan sawmli ka khupboh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa kungah, ka ngen a, Aw Mangpa Pasian, na thupina a na tatdoh, khut hattah a, Izipt gam a kipat na tatkhieh na mite leh na goutante sumang sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na suoh Abraham Isaak leh Jakob te thei zing inlen, tam mite aphengphitnate uh, agitlounate u’leh akheldante uh en sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khuchilouin vang na hing puidohna gam a miten, “Mangpa’n akung ua achiem gam a a puilut zoulou zieh leh amaute a muda zieh a, gamdai a thagam dinga apuidoh ahi,” achi kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amaute khu na silbawltheina thupitah leh na banzah a na puidoh, na mite leh na goutante ahi uhi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Khum hun laiin Mangpa’n ka kungah, suongpeh ni tu masanga bangin kheng kia inlen, muol tungah ka kungah hing kaltou inlen, singkuong bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh tua suongpehte tungah, tu masanga suongpeh na sekehte tunga thu kigielte ka giel dinga, singkuong sungah na koi ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n gichil sing giltahin singkuong ka bawla, tumasanga, bang suongpeh ni ka khenga, tua suongpeh nite tawiin muol tungah ka kaltouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh suongpeh tegel ah, tumasanga kigiel bang bangin, na kikhop khawm ni ua, muol tunga meikuong lah apat a, Mangpa’n agensa thusawmpiehte khu agiela; tuachi’n Mangpa’n ka kungah ahing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka kihei a, muol a pat ka hing kumsuh a, suongpehte khu ka singkuong bawl sungah ka koi a, tualeh Mangpa hing thupieh bangin khunah a um denta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate khu Be-eroth Bene Jaakante tuikhuh a kipat in Moserah atung ua, tua mun ah Aaron a shi a, avuita uhi. Tuachi’n atapa Eleazar in ama thahengin siempu na asem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum mun apat in akipandoh ua, Gudgodah mun atung ua; Gudgodah akipat in lui tuite tamna gam Jotbath atung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khum hun laiin Mangpa’n Levi phung khu, tuni tana Mangpa thuhun bawm pawding leh A nna seppieh a, Mangpa masanga ding diing leh Amin phat dingin akhentuom ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin Levi in a unaute lah ah tanvou leh goutan anei sih hi; Mangpa na Pasian un akung ua a chiemsa bangin, Mangpa khu a goutan uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tualeh masanglaima bangin muol tungah ni sawmli leh zan sawmli ka um a, tualeh khumlaiin zong Mangpa’n ka thu angaikhie a, Mangpa’n noute ahing sumang nuom ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n ka kungah, Thou inlen mipite makai inlen pui in; amaute pieh dinga apu leh pate uh kunga ka kichiemna gam aluo theina dingun, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Khaile, Israelte aw, Mangpa na Pasian un nou apat ahing phut bang ahiei: Mangpa na Pasian khu na giin ua, alampite na zui ua tualeh Ama na it ua na lungtang zousie leh na hinna zousie ua ana nasep u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tunia na hoina ding ua, thu ka hing pieh, Mangpa thupiehte leh adanthute zui khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai un, van leh vansangpente leh leitung leh a sunga um zousie Mangpa na Pasian ua ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh napu leh pate uh it ding pen Mangpa kipahna lamtah ahia, anua ua ahahasuonte uh noute mama khu midang zousie tungah ahing na telta hi, tunia na hi bangun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ziehin na lungtang tep uh tan unlen paupeng nawn sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa na Pasian u khu, pasiente Pasian leh mangpate Mangpa, Pasian silbawlthei leh thupi leh chizat huoi, koima deisah tuom neilou, golguh na zong la ngailou, Pasian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman Pa neiloute leh meithaite tungthu vai ahawm pieh a, Aman gamdang mite khu nehletah, sille ten pie in alungsiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin gamdang mite it un; nou zong Izipt gam ah mikhuol nana hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian u’khu na giin ding uh ahi, Ama nna nasep pieh ding ua, Ama na tudet ding ua, tualeh Amin a na kichiem ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama khu na phat dingpa uh ahi, tam na mit ua na mu taah uh, sil thupitah leh chizat huoi tahte hing bawlpiehpa khu na Pasian uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Napu leh pate uh mi sawm sagi Izipt ah a peisuh ua, tuin vang Mangpa na Pasian un a tamlam in van a aasi zain ahing tam sah ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tuaziehin Mangpa na Pasian uh it unlen, athupiehte adanthute leh avaihawmna danthute leh a thupiehte na zui ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuni’n thei un, Mangpa na Pasian uh, thununnate, athupidante, akhut hatdante, abanzah dante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Achiemtenate, asilbawlte, Izipt gam sunga, Izipt leengpa Pharaoh tung leh agam sung zousie a abawlte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Izipt galkapte tung leh asakolte uh tung leh asakollengte utunga abawl dante, noute ahing nuadel lai ua; tuipisan a amaute atumsah dante leh tunia Mangpa’n amaute asuhmang dante.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tam mun na hing tun masangsie ua, gamdai a na tung ua, asilbawl dante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Reuben tapa Eliab tapa Dathan leh Abiram tunga abawl dante: lei in akam akah a, a innkuonpite zousie u’leh, a puonbuhte u’leh, Israel tate lah a kipat a, anei alam zousie utoh avaltum dan, theikhalou leh mu khalou, na tate kung ua, thu gen ka hi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh na mit ngei un, Mangpa sil thupi bawl zousie na mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tuaziehin na hing hat theina ding u’leh, na va luo ding uh gam a, na lut ua na luo theina ding un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh khuoizu leh nawitui luonna gam, napu leh pate u’leh ahah asuonte u’kunga pieh ding a Mangpa’n achiemsa gam a naten sawt theina dingun, tunia thupieh ka hing piehte zousie na zui ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua nava luo ding uh gam khu, na hing pawtdoh na uh Izipt haichi na tu ua, na keng ua tui nabuoh uh ante louhing huon bang ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh na valuo ding uh gam khu, van guo tui ne muol leh guomte ahizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un akep zing gam ahia; Mangpa na Pasian uh mit, atungah atu ngitnget hi, kumbul a kipat in kumtawp tandong in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tualeh hichi ahing hiding a, Mangpa na Pasian uh it ding leh na lungtang zousie u’leh na hinna zousie ua, ana semdinga ka thupieh tunia ka hing piehte phatuomngaitah a, na zui u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuachi’n na gam guotui uh ahuntahin, guotui ke masa leh guotui ke nukhia ka hing pe ding a, tuachi’n na bute uh, na uoin tha te uh leh na sathaute uh na lakhawm thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh na ganhonte ua dingin na gam uah hampa ka pousah dinga; nouten zong na ne ding ua na tai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pilvang un khuchilouin na lungtang uh sol in aum dinga, na piel mang ua, pasien dangte nna nasem ding ua, na be kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na khuchi u’leh, Mangpa lungthahna khu na tung uah akuong ding a, guo zuhlouna ding in vankot a khah dinga, leiin aga asuo sih dinga; tualeh Mangpa’n ahing pieh gam hoi a kipat in na mangthai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tuaziehin tam ka thute na lungtang u’leh, na hinna uah na koi ding ua, chiemtena ding in na khut uah naviel ding ua, na mit kaal uah talgahna bang in na nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tamte khu na tate uh na hil ding ua, na inn ua na tou chieng un, lampi a na pei chieng un, tualeh na thaw chieng bang un, na gen zel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh na kotbiengte u’leh na kottungte uah na giel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n napu leh pate u’kunga pieh dinga akichiemna gam ah na dam sung nite u’leh na tate uh dam sung nite vante nite bang in asawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh it ding leh alampite zousie zui dinga, tualeh Ama tudet chinten dinga, na bawl ding ua nou ka hing pieh tam thupiehte pilvangtah a na zuipou u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mangpa’n tam namte zousie ahing deldoh pieh dinga, nou sanga thupizaw leh silbawlthei zaw namte gam na luo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na keng phang ua, na totkhahna pouma uh nou a ahi dinga, gamdai akipat Lebanon dong, tualeh Euphrates lui akipat tumlam tuipi dongin, na gam uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi koima na masang uah ading ngam sih ding ua, Mangpa na Pasian un na kung ua agensa bangin, nava tot ding gam zousie uah, noute giinna leh zauna a um sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ngai un tuni in na masang uah guolzawlna leh gausapna ka koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh thupieh tunia ka hing piehte na zui u’leh guolzawlna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian uh thupiehte zuilou a, na thei ngailou uh pasien dangte be dinga tunia ka hing thupiehte na pielsan u’leh gausapna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi ding a, nava luoding uh gam a, Mangpa na Pasian un ahing puilut chiengin, guolzawlna khu Gerizim muol ah na koi ding ua, gausapna Ebal muol tungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na theisa bangun, tam muolte gel khu Jordan luigal nitumna lam a, lampi Arabah gamsunga teng Kanaanmite gamsung Gilgal toh kigalsai Moreh gangpi sing kunga um ahi sih uh amah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un ahing pieh gam, valuo dingin Jordan na kan ding uh ahi, na luo ding ua khunah na teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh tunia na masang ua ka koi thupiehte leh vaihawmna dante zousie zui dingin na pilvang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mangpa napu leh pate uh Pasian in ahing pieh gam na luo ua, leitunga na um sungsie ua, pilvangtah a, na zui ding uh dante leh vaihawmna dante tamte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na valuo ding uh gam a namten taang tungte leh muol tungte leh sing hing chinteng nuoi lah a, a pasiente uh abiehna munte zousie uh na suhsiet pieh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A maitamte uh na suhsiet pieh ding ua, amilim suongphute uh na satguoi ding ua, tualeh singa kibawl a pasien limte uh mei in na hal ding ua; amilim khenthute uh na satpua pieh ding ua, tua mun akipat aminte uh na phietmang pieh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuabang silte toh Mangpa na Pasian uh na bieh lou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa na Pasian un, na nam zousie lah ua amin umna dinga aguot min na sui zaw ding ua khunah na peizawding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuamun ah na halmang sillatte uh, na kithoinate uh, na sawma khatte uh, na thuchiemna sillatte uh, na khut ua na vei sillatte uh, na kiphalna sillatte uh leh na ganhonte u’leh na belamhonte u’lah a, pieng masapente na hing tawi ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh khummun ah Mangpa na Pasian uh masangah na ne ding ua, nou leh na innkuonpite utoh, Mangpa’n ahing guolzawlna, na khut nasep tung uah nuom tahin na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Michin in amauh mitmu a hoi asahdan banga, tunia ibawl bang ua, na bawl ding uh ahi vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un na luo ding ua ahing pieh gam leh khawlna mun leh gam ah nahing tung naita di sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh Jordan lui na galkai ua, Mangpa na Pasian un luodinga, ahing piehna gam a na ten chiengun, bittah a na um theina ding ua, na kimvel ua na melmate zousie ua kipat khawldamna ahing pieh chiengin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuatahchiengin Mangpa na Pasian un, Amin umsahna dinga aguotna mun ah na hing tawi ding ua, thu ka hing pieh zousie khunah na hing tawi ding uh ahi, na halmang sillalte uh, na kithoinate uh, na sawma khatte uh, na khut ua na vei sillatte uh, na Mangpa kunga na kichiemna sillat hoi nou noute uh na hing tawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian uh masangah, nou leh na tapate u’leh, na tanute u’leh, na suohpa u’leh, na suohnute utoh, nuomsatahin na um ding uhi, na huongsung ua um Levi mite toh zong; aziehpen amaun na lah uah tanvou anei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mun na muna pou ua, na halmang sillatte uh lan lou dingin pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh na namte u’lah a Mangpa’n a guot ding mun ah na halmang sillatte uh na lan zaw ding ua, khummun ah thu kahing pieh zousie na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Bangtenghileh, Mangpa na Pasian un, guolzawlna ahing pieh dungzui a, na hinna un alunggul pouma na huongsung zousie uah, sa na gou thei ding ua, na ne thei ding uhi; a siengloute leh a siengten zong sangaite, sakhi sate akibangin ane thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sisan vang na neh ding uh ahisih a, lei a tui buoh banga na buoh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na huongsung uah na bu uh sawma khatte ahiei, na uoin thate uh ahiei, na sathaute uh ahiei, na ganhonte u’leh na belam honte uh tapieng masate ahiei, na sillatte uh khat poupou, na kichiemna sillatte uh ahiei, na kiphalna bang ua na sillatte u’ahiei na khut ua na vei sillatte u’ahiei, na neh theilou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa na Pasian un amun guot ding ah, Mangpa na Pasian u’masangah, noute leh na tapate u’leh, na tanute u’leh, na suohpate u’leh na suohnute u’leh na huongsung ua um Levimite toh na ne zaw ding uhi, tualeh Mangpa na Pasian uh masanga na khut ngapna pou uah nuomsa tahin na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na gam ua na dam sungsie un Levimite ngaisah lou a koi lou dingin pilvangun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian un ahing thuchiem banga, na gamgi uh ahing kehlet pieh chiengin, na hinna un saneh alunggul zieha sa kane ut hi na chi hun chiengun, na hinna un a lunggul pouma na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un Amin umna dinga deitel a aguotna mun khu nou apata agamlat seng leh Mangpa’n ahing pieh na ganhonte u’leh na belamhonte lah ua te, thu ka hing pieh bangin na gou thei ding ua, na hinna un alunggul lampang na huongsung uah na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sangai sa leh sakhi sate akineh bang in, na ne ding ua, asieng leh asienglou ten zong akibangin na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asisan ne vawtlou dingin pilvang un, sisan khu hinna ahi, hinna nangawn toh sa na neh ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na ne vawtsih ding ua, tui banga lei a, na buoh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa mitmu a sildih na bawl u’leh, nou leh na nua chieng ua na tate ua dinga ahoi theina ding in tuakhu na ne sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na sil siengthou neite u’leh na kichiemna sillatte maimai uh tawi unlen, Mangpa’n deitel a aguot na ding mun ah na pei zel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh na halmang sillatte u’leh sa leh sisan khu Mangpa na Pasian uh maitam tungah na lan ding ua, tualeh na kithoina sisan khu Mangpa na Pasian maitam tungah na sungbaw ding ua, asa na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam ka hing thupiehte zousie ngaisah unlen, pilvang tahin ngaikhie un, tuachi’n Mangpa na Pasian uh mitmu in sil hoi leh dih na bawl ding ua, nou ding leh na nua ua na tate uh dingin kumtawnin ahing hoitou zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian un, na luoding uh gam a namte na masang ua kipat ahing suhbei pieh sienga, na deldoh ua, agam ua na ten hun chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na masang ua pat a suhmangthai a aum bang ua na awhkhahlou na dingun pilvang unlen, tam namten bangchibangin ahiei a pasiente uh nna aseppieh uh? a bawl bangun eiten zong ibawl ding uh chiin, a pasiente uh tungtang kan se sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuabangin Mangpa na Pasian tung uah na bawl ding uh ahisih hi; a pasien tung uah Mangpa theiin sil kidahhuoi chinteng ahuot mamate abawl zel ua, atapate u’leh atanute ngel u’zong a pasiente ua dingin mei ah ahal zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Zui dinga thu ka hing pieh pouma pilvang tahin zui un, na belap dinguh ahisih a, na lahkiem ding uh zong ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Na lah ua guolnei ahiei, mangsan mi hiei, a hing umdoh a, chiemtena ahiei, sillamdang ahiei, ahing etsah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh chiemtena ahiei, sillamdang ahiei ahing etsah khu ahing tangtun a na kung ua, na thei ngailou uh pasien dangte izui ding ua, ana uh iseppieh ding uh, achi u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua guolneipa ahiei leh mangsanpa ahiei, thu gente na ngaikhieh ding uh ahi sih hi. Mangpa na Pasian uh na lungtang zousie u’leh na hinna zousie un na it na uoi mah chi theina dinga Mangpa na Pasian un ahing etkhiehna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh nua na zui ding ua, Ama giindan na siem ding ua, athupiehte na zui ding ua, athugente na mang ding ua, anate na sem ding ua, Ama na tuhdet chinten ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh tua guolneipa ahiei, Mangsanmi ahiei khu, thalia ding ahi, azieh pen aman Izipt gam a kipat a, nou hing puidohpa leh na saltanna inn ua kipata hing tandohpa, kihei mangsan dingin, Mangpa na Pasian un zuidinga thu ahingpieh lampi akipat hing piel sah tum a, Mangpa na Pasian uh tunga helna thu agen ziehin. Tuabangin na lah ua kipat a sil hoilou na koimang ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Na sanggampa, na nu tapa ahiei, na tapa ahiei, na tanu ahiei, na pom lai na zi ahiei, na lawm nangma hinna banga na ngaivawt ahiei nangawn in zong, simthama ahing solbawl ua, kisa vaiin, nangleh napu leh paten zong athei ngailou, pasien dangte na sem vai chia aguh a ahing zawl u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kim navel u’leh na kung nai ua um ahiei, nou a kipata gamlapi kawlmong langkhat akipata kawlmong lelam donga um mite pasiente, bevai in ana u’zong sem vai achi u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pha na sahpi ding uh ahi sih, athu zong na ngaikhieh ding uh ahi sih a, hepina mit a zong na et ding uh ahisih, na khawi ding u’zong ahisih a, tualeh na iim ding u’zong ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh na thalia ngei ngei ding uh ahizaw hi, thatlia dingin khut naha masa pen dinga, tuazou chiengin midang zousie in aha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh ama khu ashi masangsie na sep dinga, na selia tei tei dinguh ahi, Izipt gam a na saltanna inn a kipat a hing puidohpa Mangpa na Pasian uh kunga kipat a ahing puimangna ding a sui ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelmi zousie in a za ding ua, a zau ding ua, na lah ua tuabang tatsietna mawngmawng a bawl nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian un na tenna ding ua ahing pieh na khopite uh khat a, na lah ua pat migilou lawikhat hing pawtkhie a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khum khopi a mite, na thei ngailou uh pasien dangte be dingin apuimang chi na thei u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan chien unlen sui chien un, tualeh phatuomngai tahin dongun. Tualeh tam thu khu thudih ana hi a khumbanga sil kidahhuoi na lah ua a kibawl nahi chi theichien ahileh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khum khopi a tengte, namsau a na satlia ngei ngei ding uh ahi; asunga tengte zousie leh aganhon zousie u’toh namsau a na suhmang thai sieng ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh gallah sum zousie khu khopi laikim tah ah na sie khawm ding ua, khuo leh gallah sum zousie khu Mangpa na Pasian ua dingin meiin na haltum ding uhi; khumkhu tungvum lienpi asuoh denta ding a, tunding kia ahinawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin hamsethuoh sil bangma na khut ua aum ding ahi sih hi, tuachi’n Mangpa’n alungthahna zauhuoitah akiheisan dinga, napu leh pate u’kunga akichiemna bang in noute ahing khotuo ding a, na tung uah hepina anei ding a, ahing pung sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh mitmu a sil dih bawl ding a, tunia ka hing pieh a thupieh zousie zui dinga Mangpa na Pasian uh thugen na ngai khiet bang un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Noute Mangpa na Pasian uh tate na hi ua, mishi ziehin na tahsa tunguh na at ding uh ahisih a, na hum sam u’zong na heukieu ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Noute Mangpa na Pasian ua dinga nam siengthou na hi ua, tualeh leitung nam zousie lah apat Ama goutan tuom ding mawngmawng a, Mangpa’n ahing teldoh na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Sil kidahhuoi mawngmawng na nehlou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tamte na neh thei ding uh gantate ahi: Bawngtal, belam leh kel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sakhi, sangai, sazuhtal, gamkel, sakel, Zangsiel leh gambelam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh sate lah a akeng chin kaa a aka peisuoh, ann kia hai pouma na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahivang in sate lah a annkia hai a, a keng chin u’lah kaa ngalte, sa ngawngsau bang, zupi leh bilpite bang na neh lou ding uh ahi; aziehpen tam saten annkia ahai vang un akeng chinte uh akaa sih a, tuaziehin nou a dingin a siengsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh voh pen akeng chin akaa vangin annkia ahai lou ziehin nou adingin sienglou ahia, asa na neh ding uh ahisih a, ashiluong zong na tham khah ding uh ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tuisunga tengte lah ah tamte na ne thei ding uhi; veng leh lip nei zousie na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh veng leh lip neilou pouma na ne thei sih ding uhi; tuate nou a dinga sienglou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Va sieng zousie na nethei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh tamte vang na nehlou ding uh ahi, mukel langta, muvanlai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Musan, mubuong, mukhau leh mu zat mawngmawngte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Va-ah zat pouma.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Simbu, vabah, va ngawngkieu leh tuivakhu, tualeh mukhau leh mu neu zat pouma.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Simbuneu, simbulien leh simbukangte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuivatawt, musane, kaikuong gal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuivakengsang, tuiva ngawngsau leh azat pouma, suongpal leh baah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh ganhing bohvah leengthei pouma nou a ding in sienglou ahi dinga, na nehlou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Va sieng zousie na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ama a shi bangma na neh ding uh ahisih, na huongsunga um gamdang mite neh ding in nape thei ding uhi, ahisihleh namdang mite kungah zong na zua thei ding uhi, aziehpen Mangpa na Pasian ua dingin noute nam siengthou na hi uhi. “Kelnou api nawitui a na huon ding ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Kumchin in nalou ua na hawsuo pieng zousie uh, sawma khat dihtah a, na pieh ngei ngei ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mangpa na pasien uh giindan na theisiem ngitnget na dingun na bu u’leh, na uoin tha u’leh, na sathaute uh sawm a khat, na ganhon u’leh na belamhon lah ua pieng masapente uh, Mangpa na Pasian uh masang ah, Amin umna dinga a guotna ding mun ah, na neh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa na Pasian un ahing guolzawl hun chienga, Mangpa na Pasian un amin umna dinga aguotna mun khu nou a dinga agamlat seng tahluot zieh a, ahisihleh alampite asau seng zieha, na sawm ua khatte na hing tawi thei sih u’leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuate khu sum na suo ding ua, tua sum khu na khut un na hing tawi ding ua, Mangpa na Pasian un a umna ding a guotna mun ah, na pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh tua sum khu na lungtang un alunggul pouma, bawngtal ahiei, belam ahiei, uoin ahiei, zuchia ahiei, ahisihleh na lungtang un adeilam pouma adingin na zang ding ua, tualeh khunah Mangpa na Pasian uh masang ah na ne ding ua, nou leh na innkuonte utoh nuomsa tahin na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na huongsung ua um Levimite ngaisah louin na taisan ding uh ahi sih hi; azieh pen amauten na lah uah tanvou leh goutan anei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Kumthum achin kum tawp chiengin, khum kuma na hawsuoh sil tungte zousie ua, sawma khat na hing tawikhawm ding ua, na umna huong sung uah na koi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh na huongsung ua um Levimite zong (Amaun na lah ua tanvou leh goutan anei lou zieh un) tualeh na huongsung ua um gamdangmi, paneiloute leh meithaiten ane ding ua, ahing khosa thei ding uhi, tuachi’n Mangpa na Pasian un na khut nasep leh silbawl zousie uah ahing guolzawl thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Kum sagi abei chin in, leibat ngaidamna na bawl ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh ngaidam ding dan khu tambang ding ahi, leiba basahmi poumain a innvengte aleitawisah khu angaidam ding uh ahi, a innveng ahiei, a unau ahiei zong aphul paupau ding ahisih hi, aziehpen tam khu Mangpa ngaidamna kichi khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gamdangmi ahileh na phul teitei thei ding uhi, hinanleh na unau in nou a abat khah pouma na ngaidam ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami ziehin koima na gentheisah sih ding uhi, azieh pen Mangpa na Pasian un na luo ding ua ahing pieh gam ah thupitahin a hing guol zawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tunia ka hing pieh tam thupiehte zousie zuidinga Mangpa na Pasian uh thugen pilvang tah a na ngai khieh pou ua ahileh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un ahing chiem bangin, ahing guolzawl dinga, nam tampite na leitawi sah ding ua, nou vangin na leitawi sih ding uh, nam tampite tungah vai na hawm ding ua; noute tungah koiman vai ahawm sih ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian un ahing pieh ding gam a na umna ua, na khopi huongsung ua, na unaute lah a, mi genthei a um leh na unau gentheipa tungah na lungtang khausah sih unlen, chip zong na chiplou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh atung uah na silphal mama ding ua, atahsapna uh awng huhna ding khop na leitawi sah ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngaidamna kum, kum sagina hing tung ding ahita chiin na unau genthei tunga mudana lungsim nei a, bangma pephallou a na lungtanga ngaituona giloutah um loudingin pilvangun, khuchilou in aman na tungah Mangpa ahan dinga, nanga dingin khelna ahi kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na pieh ngei ngei ding uh ahi, na pieh chieng ua zong na lungtang uh na natsah ding uh ahisih hi, tam silte ziehin ahi, Mangpa na Pasian un, na sil bawl zousie u’leh nasep zousie u’leh na khut ngatna zousie uh ahing guolzawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen khum gam alah migenthei umlou lai a um sih dinga, tuaziehin na gam ua na unaute uh tung leh mi tasamte leh gentheite tungah panpina lungsim nei a silphal mama dingin thu ka hing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Na unau Hebru pasal ahiei, Hebru numei ahiei, na kung ua ahing zua u’leh, kum guhsung na nna uh asem ding ua, akum sagina kum ah navahtahin na pawt sah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nou a kipat a zalentah a, na pawtsah hun chiengun khutguoha na pawtsah lou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na belamhonte ua kipat, na buphuol ua kipat, na uoin suhna khuh ua kipat in, itlou tahin na pe ding uhi; Mangpa na Pasian un ahing guolzawl dan dungzui in nape ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Izipt gam ah suoh leh sal in na nna umta ua, Mangpa na Pasian un ahing tandoh chi na thei zing ding uh ahi; Tuaziehin tuniin tam thute ka hing pie ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, noute leh na innkuonpite uh angai man u’leh, na kunga um nuom asah zieh ua, ka hing pawtsan sih ding achi u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Siatul khat na la ding ua, kotlam zungah abil uh na vu pieh ding uhi, tuachi’n kumtawn in na suoh uh ahi ding uhi. Tualeh na suohnu u’zong tua mabangin na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na kung ua pat a na pawtsah ding u’pen nou a dinga sil hasa a, na ngailou ding uh ahi, aziehpen kilaw suoh nasep leni sem in kum guh sung na nna ahing sep piehta hi. Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian un nasep nabawl zousie uah ahing guolzawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Na ganhonte lah u’leh na belam honte lah ua atal pieng masapente zousie, Mangpa na Pasian uh tuom dingin na pe ding uhi; na bawngtal pieng masapen uh nna sema na zah ding uh ahisih a, na belam pieng masapen u’zong amul na met ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang leh na innkuonpiten, Mangpa na Pasian uh masangah, kum chinin Mangpa’n adei tel mun guot ding munah nane ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh nuolna um ahiei, akengbai ahiei, mitto ahiei, nuolna um mawngmawng, Mangpa na Pasian uh kunga kithoina dinga na zah ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na khopi sungte uah na ne ding uhi; mi siengloute leh siengten zong kibangin sangaite leh sakhite bangin na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A sisan pen vang na neh vawtlou ding uh ahi; tuol a tui buoh banga na buoh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ABIB ha tang unlen, Mangpa na Pasian ua ding in peikan annkuong luina dingin zang un. Abib ha in Mangpa na Pasian un Izipt gam a kipat zanlai a, ahing puidoh ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n amin umna dinga adeitelna ding mun ah, Mangpa na Pasian kung uah, na ganhon lah u’leh na belam honte lah ua kipat in peikan pawi dingin na kithoi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tanghou tol kisaw toh na neh ding uh ahisih hi; na damsung teng ua Izipt gam a kipat a, na pawtdoh ni uh na theizingna dingun, kisuhgimna tanghou tolsawlou toh ni sagi sung na ne ding uhi; aziehpen Izipt gam apat kinawtah a pawtdoh na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh na gam sung uah ni sagi sung mawngmawng tol akimukhah vawtlou ding ahi, tualeh ni khatni nitahlam a na kithoina sa uh zan tungtawn leh azingni zingmawng tandongin bangma a um ding ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un ahing pieh na khopi huongsung kholai pou ah peikan pawi kithoina na bawl thei sihding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa na Pasian un Amin umna dinga a guotna ding mun maimai ah ahidinga, khum mun ah, Izipt gam a kipat a na hing pawtdoh hun laitah uh nitahlam nitumkuon chiengin, peikan pawi kithoina in na kithoi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh mei ah na em ding ua, Mangpa na Pasian un aguot ding mun ah nane ding uhi, tualeh zingmawng chieng in na kinuale ding ua, na puon inn uah na pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni guh sung tanghou tolsawlou na ne ding ua, tualeh ani sagini pen Mangpa na Pasian ua dingin khawmpi siengthou ahi dinga, khum hun sungin nna nasep ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nipikaal sagi nasim ding ua, na bu lah chiil ua kipat in na pan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un ahing guolzawl bang zel a na khut nasep ga suote lah ua, nouma ut thu a na silpiehte uh lan in, Mangpa na Pasian ua dingin nipikaal pawi na bawl ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian un Amin umna dinga a guotna mun dingah, na suohpate uh, na suohnute uh, na khopi huongsung ua um Levimite, na lah ua um gamdang mite, pa neiloute leh meithaite toh Mangpa na Pasian uh masangah nuomsa tahin na um ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Izipt gamah suoh leh sal na hi uh chi zong na theizing ding uh ahi, tualeh tam dan thupiehte pilvangtah a na zui ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Na buphuol ua kipat leh na uoin suhna khuh ua kipat a na sehkhawm zou chiengun, ni sagi sung hampheng pawi na bawl ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na pawi bawlna uah noutoh, na tapate, na tanute, na suohpate, na suohnute leh na khopi huongsung ua um Levimite, gamdang mite, pa neiloute leh meithaite toh nuomtahin na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mangpa’n adeitelna mun ah, Mangpa na Pasian ua dingin ni sagi sung vingveng pawi na bawl ding ua, Mangpa na Pasian un na hawsuo zousie u’leh na khut nasep silbawl zousie uh ahing guolzawl dinga, kipahtah in na umkhawm chiet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kumkhat sungin na pasalte zousie uh, Mangpa na Pasian uh masangah Aman ahing guotpiehna ding mun ah akilang ding uhi, tolsawlou tanghou pawi ah, nipikalte pawi ah, tualeh hampheng pawi ah; Mangpa masangah khutguoh a akilat ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un guolzawlna ahing musah bang zelin michin in apieh thei kham kham uh ape ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian un ahing pieh na khopi huongsung zousie uah, na nam sung chiet ua pat in vaihawmte leh lamkaite na kiguot chiet ding uh ahi, tualeh amauten mipite vai dihtah in a hawm pieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thudih khu na ut dan un heikawi sih unlen, koima deisahtuom na nei ding uh ahi sih, ne zong negu sih un, nehguhin mipilte mit atosah a, midihte dihna zong aheikawi pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un ahing pieh gam, dama na luo theina dingun dihtatna na zui ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian uh maitam na bawlna gei ah singa kibawl milimte na phulou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un a huot suong milim khuomte zong na phu dinguh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Bawngtal ahiei, belamtal ahiei, nuolna nei leh genbang mawngmawng a, Mangpa na Pasian u’kunga na kithoi ding uh ahi sih hi, khum khu Mangpa na Pasian ua dingin sil kidahhuoi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na lah ua Mangpa na Pasian un ahing pieh na umna khopi huongsung khat poupou uah zong pasal ahiei, numei ahiei, thuhun palsan a, Mangpa na Pasian uh mitmu a, silgilou abawl ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thupiehte zuilou a, pasien dangte ni hiin, ha hiin van a um van thupina khat pou pou nna asep ua, amaute a bieh u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh tua khu ahing kihil a, nouten na zah ua, phatuomngaitah a na kan chien ua; tualeh ngaiin tuabang sil kidahhuoi Israelte lah a akibawlna hi chi adih a, akichientah ngel ahileh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua silgilou bawlmi pasal ahiei, numei ahiei, khu na kulpi kotkha pulam ah na puidoh ding ua, tua Pasal ahiei, numei ahiei khu suongin na seplia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Theipimi ni ahiei, thum ahiei, kam a kipata theichet na toh suhlup ding mi khu, suonga selia ahi dinga, hinanleh theipimi khat kam a pat selia ding ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama selupna ding in theipi miten atung ah khut aha masa ding ua, tuazou chiengin mipite zousie’n a khut uh aha ding uh, tuabangin na lah ua pat silgilou na koimang ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Na khopi sung ua sisan suo thute, dihna kituna thute, kivuoh kisatna thute, kituoh louna thu zousie nou a dinga thukhen hamsataluo ahing um leh, Mangpa na Pasian un mun ahing guot piehna ding mun ah na pei ding ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khum hun a siempu Levite leh vaihawm mite kungah na hing pei ding ua, na dong ding uhi; tuachi’n amauten na thukhen dan ding ahing hil ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n nouten Mangpa’n mun ahing guot piehna ding a kipat a, thutan dingdan ahing na kawhmu dung zui un na bawl ding ua, tualeh ahing kawhmu dan bang zel un pilvang tahin na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thutan dan ang na hilte u’leh vaihawm dan ang na kawhmu dan bang zel in na bawl ding uhi, thutan dan ang na kawhmute uh zietlam ahiei, veilam ahiei a, na pielsan ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh masanga, nasem a ding zing siempu leh, thukhenmi, thugen sanglou a, engtat tei tei mi khu, ashi ngei ngei ding ahi. Israelte lah ah tuabang mi gilou na suhmang ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi zousien aza ding ua, azau ding ua a engtat ngam nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian un ahing pieh ding gam nava tun ua, nava luo ua, nava ten ua, i kim ivel a nam zousiete bangin leeng nei va ui, na hing chi hun chieng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un ateldoh pen pen leengpa in na nei ding uh ahi, na unau lah ua mikhat na leengpa ding ua na bawl dinguh ahi, na unau uh hilou, gamdangmi na bawl ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh aman sakol tampi nei atup ding ahi sih a, sakol tampi anei theina ding in mite Izipt gam a anua sawlkia ding zong ahi sih hi; Mangpa’n lah Tubansie khum gamah na kinuale kia nawn sih ding uhi, chiin na kung uah ana genta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh alungtang akiheimang louna ding in zi tampi anei ding zong ahi sih a, dangka leh sana zong tampi anei tuplou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, agam Mangtoupha tunga atou chiengin Levimi siemputen a kep zing uh dan khu laibu khat ah agielkhe sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuakhu akem ding a, adam sung teng asim zel ding hi. Tam danthute leh athupiehte zousie pom a zui leh bawl ding a, Mangpa a Pasian zaudan akizil theina ding leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A unaute tunga alungtang akisahthei louna ding leh, thupiehte apat zietlam ahiei, veilam ahiei a, a pielmangsan louna ding leh Israelte lah a ama leh ahahasuonte aleenggam a adamsawt theina dingun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Levi siempute leh Levi nam zousie in Israelte lah ah, tanvou leh goutan bangma anei sih ding uhi; amauten Mangpa dinga mei a sillatte leh atantuomte uh ane ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaun a unaute ulah ah goutan anei sih ding uhi, Aman a kung ua achiem tah ma bang in Mangpa khu agoutan uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kithoina sillat lan mipite lah apat in siempu tanvou ding khu bawngtal hiin, belam hitaleh, siempupa alieng leh akhaphang leh agilpi apieh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na bulebal uh, na uoin uh, na sathau tung masapente u’leh na belam mulmet masahpente u’zong ama na pieh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un ama leh atapate kum tawn a Mangpa mina nasem a ding dingin na nam zousie lah ua pat atelta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tualeh Levimi khat in Israel gam sung zousie a na khopi huongsung khat poupou pawtsan a, Mangpa’n a guot ding mun lunggul chinten a, ahing pei leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum mun a Mangpa masanga ding zing a unau Levite mabangin, Mangpa a Pasian min in nna asem ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asiemput man uh simlouin, midangte tanvou bang neh ding atang veve ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian un ahing pieh gam a na hing tun chiengun, khum gam a namte sil kidahhuoi bawlte na zui ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lah ua mi koipou atapa ahiei, atanu ahiei, milim pasien biehna kithoina sillat dinga meikuong lai a paite, ahiei, aisanmi ahiei, mangsan mi ahiei, mit phiel dawitawi ahiei, dawithu a mibumsiemte ahiei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahisihleh zawldei ai tawi mi ahiei, hagau buate toh kihoute ahiei, mishite donga aisante ahiei, mawngmawng na lah ua mukhah ahilou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen tam bang sil bawlte pouma, Mangpa dinga kidahhuoi ahia, tualeh tam sil kidahhuoite ziehin Mangpa na Pasian un amaute na masang ua pat a adelmang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh masangah na hoibukim ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na valuo dinguh gam a namten, mangsante leh aisante thu angaikhe leng ua, noute vang Mangpa na Pasian un tuabanga na bawl ding uh aphal sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian un keima bang na lah u’leh na unaute lah ua apat guolnei ahing tungdoh ding a; Ama thu na ngaikhieh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa i Pasian aw hing zasah nawn sinlen, tam meikuong zong hing musah nawn sin ka shi khading uhi, chia Horeb muola na kikhopkhawm ni ua, Mangpa na Pasian uh na lunggul bangun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n ka kungah, athu gen uh agen hoi mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A unaute lah ua kipat nangma bang guolnei khat ka tundohpieh dinga, akam ah ka thute ka koi dinga, akunga ka thupieh pouma akung uah a gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, ka min a agending ka thute pomlou pouma keiman ka ngaituo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh gen ding thu ka piehloupi ka min a gen teitei guolnei ahisihleh pasien dangte min a thugen guolnei ahiei, tuabang guolnei khu ashi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na lungtang ua Mangpa’n agenlou thu ahi chi, bangchiin ithei diei na chi ua ahileh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Guolnei khat in Mangpa min a thu agen a, athugen pen ahing tangtun sih a, alawchin sihleh, tua khu Mangpa genlou ahi, guolnei in agintat thu agen ahia, ama na giin ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian un agam uh ahing pieh ding namte, Mangpa na Pasian un a suhmanga, nouten zong amaute na deldoh ua, akhopite u’leh a innte ua na ten hun chieng un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un na luoding ua ahing piehna gam ah, nou a dingin khopi thum na tuom guot ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualthat kha pouma tailut theina dingin lampite na bawl ding ua, tualeh Mangpa na Pasian un na luoding ua ahing pieh gam khu mun thum in na khen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tualeh mithatte khum mun a tailut a kihumbit thei dingte khu tambangte ahi: a innvengte toh tumasang a, kimudana zong neilou a, khut khel zieh a thatkha poumate;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi a innvengpa toh sing phua dinga gamlah a kuon a, sing phua dinga aheipi alap laitah a, a heiga akipata, aheitang kitol in a innvengpa a selia khah leh, khum khopite khat pen pen ah ahinna hum bit dingin a tailut thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachilouin alungthah soulaitahin sisan phubala pa’n mithatpa khu nuadel vanin, lampi asau seng zieh a, delpha in asatlum kha ding hi; tumasang hun peisa a, kimudana nei ahilou ziehun shitah ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin nou a dingin khopi thum na tuom guot ding uh ahi, chiin thu ka hing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian un napu leh pate u’kung a ana kichiemna banga, na gam uh ahing kehlet pieh a, tualeh napu leh pate ukunga pieh achiem gam zousie ahing pieh chieng leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh it ding leh alampite zui zing dinga, tunia thu ka hing piehte na bawl ua tam thupieh zousiete na zui pou ua ahileh, tam khopi thumte simlou khopidang thum ahing belap pieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un na goutan ding ua ahing pieh gam a mawnabei sisan akisuo lou a, na tung ua sisan maw a umlou na dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Hinanleh mi koi ahiei in a innveng a muda a, abuhdapa, asuom a, shi khop hiela, avuoh a, tualeh tam khopite lah a khat a atailut leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a khopi upate un mi sawl uhenlen, khuna pat in ang pui ding ua, ashi theina dingin sisan phubalami kungah apekhe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama na hepi ding uh ahisih a, nou dinga a hoizawh na dingin, Israel gam akipat in mawna neilou sisan suona na koimang ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian un na luo ding ua ahing pieh, na goutan gam uh na luo hun chiengun, masanglai a ana phusa na innvengte gamgi na suon pieh ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mi athulimlouna ahiei, akhelna ahiei, tungtangah theipimi khat ahun sih dinga, theipimi ni kam ahiei, thum ahiei kam akipat thu suhkip ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Theipimi dihlou khat in, mi khat silbawl a dihlou a ngoh dinga akisah leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n akiniel mitegel khu, Mangpa masang leh khum hunlai a siempu leh vaihawmte masang ah a ding diing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vaihawm miten pilvangtahin akanchien ding ua, tua theipimi theipina khu adihloupi ahia, aunau tunga dihloupi a ngoh ahi leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a unau tunga bawl atup bangin, ama tungah na bawl ding uhi, tuabangin na lah ua sil hoilou na suhmang ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh a um nalaiten aza ding ua, a zau ding ua, tunua chiengin, tam bang silgilou na lah uah koiman abawl nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na hepi ding uh ahi sih a, hinna taangin hinna, mit taangin mit, ha taangin ha, khut taangin khut, keng taangin keng, ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Na galte uh dou dinga na kuon doh ua, sakolte leh sakollengte, galkap nou sanga tamzaw na mu chiengun, na zau ding uh ahi sih hi. Izipt gam a kipat a nou hing puidohpa, Mangpa na Pasian uh na kung uah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh na kidou kuon chiengun, siempupa mipite kungah va pei henlen, va houpi henlen a kung uah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israelte aw, Ngaivawi un, tuni in na galte u’toh kidou ding na hita ua, lungkesih unlen zau sih un, chitunsih unlen, amaute giing sih un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noutoh zawhkhawma na galte uh hing doupieh ding leh noute hing hundam dinga na masang ua peipa Mangpa na Pasian uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n, lamkaiten mipite kungah, inn tha lam a lan nailou na um uoi? a inn ah nua peikia heh, kidouna ah ava shi kha dinga, midang khat in a inn a luo kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh grep huon bawla aga ne nailou na um uoi? a inn lamah pei kia heh, galdouna ah ava shi kha dinga mi dangin ane kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh, zi ding dawpsa kitenpi nailou na um uoi? a inn lamah pei kia heh, kidouna ah ashi kha dinga, mi dangin akitenpi kha ding hi, chiin agen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n lamkaiten mipite kungah, zau leh lungkie na um uoi? a inn langah nua pei kia heh, alung kieh bangin a unaupa alung kesah kha ding hi, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi ding a, lamkaiten mipite kunga thu agen zou chiengun mipite mapui ding in lamkaite aguot ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Khopi khat sim dinga na kuon ua nava nai chiengun kilemna thu gen phot un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, ahing nakileppi ut ua, ana kipah u’leh hichi ahi ding, khuna mi um zousie, na sem dinga goi ding ahing hita ding ua, na nna uh ahing sep pieh ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh nou toh kilep a ut sih ua, ahing na dou u’leh na imkhum pai ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian un, na khut ua ahing pieh chiengin, khunah pasal zousie namsau in na satlia sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh numeite leh naupangte, tualeh ganhonte leh khopi sunga um zousie leh galvan lah sil zousie na kilah ding ua, Mangpa na Pasian un ahing pieh na galte gallah silte zousie na kineh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuabangin tam namte khopite hilou, na umna ua kipat a gamlapi a um khopite zousie tungah tuabangin na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa na Pasian un na goutan ding ua ahing pieh tam namte khopite a um hinna nei zousie, na hingkhawi ding uh ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa na Pasian hing thupieh banga, Hitmite, Amormite, Kanaanmite, Perizmite, Hivmite tualeh Jebusmite na thagam sieng ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pasiente uh tunga abawl leng uh sil kidahhuoi zousie ahing zilsah louna dingun, khuchilouin Mangpa na Pasian u’tungah sil na bawlkhiel kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Lah tum a na kidoupi uh khopi khu hun sawtpi na imkhum tah chieng un, tua khopi sunga singte heipi in na phua ding uh ahi sih a, na neh ding uh ahia, na khopi sim uh imna dingin phua sih un, (aziehpen gam a sing khu mihingte neh ding ann ahi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aga neh theilou singkung ahi chi na theite u’pen na phua ding ua, na sattan ding ua, ahing doute khuo asiet masangsie kul in na imkhum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian un na luoding ua ahing pieh gam a, mi kithat a, gamlah a aluong lum akimu a, koitha ahiei chi akithei sih leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na upate u’leh na vaihawmte uh ahing pei ding ua, mi shi kithana mun apat a kim vel a khuote gamlat dan ate ding ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, luong umna akipat a kho naipen, upaten bawngla nasem nailou, hahkol zong ponailou khat ahing kai ding ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh khum khopi upaten bawngla khu, tui luonna, lou a kihou ngainailou, haichi zong kichiin khah nailouna guomah ahing kai suh ding ua, khum guom ah bawngla ngawng atan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Levi tapa siempute akung uah ahing pei ding ua: Mangpa na Pasian un amaute anasem ding leh Mangpa mina guolzawl dingin atelta hi; amaute thuin thu buoi leh kivuoh thu zousie vaihawm leh thukhen ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh mi kithatpa luong umna naipen khopi upate zousie’n guoma bawngla ngawng kitan tungah akhut uh asil ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka khut un tam sisan asuo sih a, tualeh ka mit un zong amu kha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa aw natatsa na mi Israelte ngaidam inlen, na mi Israelte tungah mawna neilou sisan suona khelna a um phal sin, chi’n adawng ding uhi. Tuachi’n sisan thu ah ngaidam ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuabangin Mangpa mitmu ah sildih bawlin, mawna neilou sisan suona khu na lah ua pat na koimang thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Nagalte uh sim dinga na kuondoh ua, Mangpa na Pasian un amaute na khut ua ahing pieh a, sal a na pui chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na sal matte lah ua numei melhoi na mu ua, na deigaw ua, zi dinga na kitenpi ut ua ahileh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu na inn uah na puilut ding ua, alu aheukieu dinga, akhut chinte atan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n asaltanna puonte asutkhe ding a, na inn uah a um denta dinga, ha khat vingveng anule apa asuun ding a, tuazou chiengin amanu na luppi dinga, apasal na hita ding a amanu zong na zi ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, atunga na lungkim sih u’leh, a ut utna a, na pei sah phal ding uh ahi, hinanleh sum leh pai a na zua lou ding uh ahi, na suh dai tahziehun, sum met bawlna a zong na neilou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mi koi ahiei in zi ni nei henlen khatpen it in khatpen muda taleh, a it nu leh amuda nu’n, ta neipieh tuoh ta u’henlen, tualeh tapa pieng masa khu a muda nu ta hitaleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahi ding hi, agoute, atapate kunga ahawm pieh hun chiengin a it nu tapa pen mudanu tapa sanga upa zawin abawl thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh agoute aleni pie in, mudanu tapa khu ta piengmasain apom ding ahi, ahatna kipatna ahi a; ta upa hina ama a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mi koi ahiei in tapa paupeng leh helhat, anu leh apa thu zong mang nuomlou, agawt vang ua zong athuhilna uh ngaikhe utlou tapa anei leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anu leh apa’n aman ding ua, akhopi upate kung ah, khopi kulkot bul ah ahing zawpi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh anu leh apa’n khopi upate kung ah, Tam ka tapa uh lungpeng tah leh helhat tah tuaban ah sapzalou ahia, ann hai leh zukham hat mi ahi, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n khopi a um mi zousie’n amapa suongin aseplia ding uhi. Tuachi’n na lah ua gitlouna umte na sumang ding ua, Israelte zousien a za ding ua, a zau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mi koi ahiei in shina khop khelna abawla, shi sah ding ahi a, sing dawna na khai u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aluong khu zan tungtawn singdawn a aumding ahi sih a, bangtenghileh khum ni mama a navui ding uh ahi. Singdawna kikhailia pouma Pasian hamsie thuoh ahi uhi. Mangpa na Pasian un na goutan ding ua ahing piehna gam khu na suh bua louna dingun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Na unaute uh bawngtal ahiei, belam ahiei, amang na mu u’leh, na kitheimaw bawlsan ding uh ahi sih a, na unaute uh inn a na kailut ngeingei ding uh ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh na unaute uh na inn kung nai ua umte a ahi sih a, aneipa na thei khahlou ahileh, na inn lang uah na kai ding ua, na kem ding ua, na unau un ahing sui hunhun chiengin na pieh kia ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asabiltung zong khum banga na bawl ding uh ahi, khumbangma in apuon silte u’zong na bawl ding uhi. Khumbangma in na unaute uh van mang na mukhah tapou uh na bawl ding ua, na kitheimaw bawl lou ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na unaupa uh sabiltung ahiei, bawngtal ahiei lampi a pua na mu u’leh na kitheimaw bawla na kilepsan ding uh ahisih a, tuate na phoh pieh tei tei ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Numei in pasal kivonna van asil ding ahisih a, pasal in zong numei puonsil asil ding ahisih hi, koizong hichibanga bawlte zousie Mangpa na Pasian ua ding in mi kidahhuoi ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Lampi a vabu singdawn ahiei, leitung ahiei a, anou ahiei, atui ahiei um; anou ahiei, atui ahiei api in a opkhum lai na mu u’leh, anou api toh nalah khawm lou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Api na hadoh ngei ngei ding uh ahi, anou pen na la thei ding uhi, tuachi’n nou a dingin ahoi ding a, na damsawt ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Inn tha na lam chieng ua, mi akieh a, na inn uh sisan suona inn ahilouna ding in, na inn tunguh na iim ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tualeh na grep huon uah haichi tuom tuom na chiin ding uh ahi sih hi, khuchilouin na haichi tu gate leh na grep gate abua kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawngtal leh sabiltung zang khawmin lou nakai ding ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samul leh vaukhau kigan khawm puon chituom tuom na sillou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Na kituomna puonsil gei lite ah among khibawh na bawl ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Mi koi ahieiin zi anei a, aluppi a, amuda kia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam numei zi in ka nei a, ka luppi leh nungah siengthou ahina ka musih chia, zumhuoitaha, abawla aminsiet sah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nungahnu nu leh paten khopi kulkotpi a, tua khopi upate kungah nungah siengthou ahina ava tahlang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Nungahnu pa in upate kungah, tam mipa ka tanu toh ka kiteng sah a, amuda kia ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuin ngai un, “Na ta nu nungah siengthou ahina ka mu sih chiin zalat huoi tahin abawla, hinanleh tamte ka tanu nungah siengthou ahina chiemte na ahi,” achi ding hi. Tuachi’n tua khopi upate masang ah puon apha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh tua khopi upaten tua mipa a zawpi ding ua agawt ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel nungah siengthou asuh minsiet ziehin dangka shekel zakhat alieu sah ding ua, nungah pa ape ding uhi. Tuachi’n azi ahi dinga, adamsung in akikhenpi thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh khum thute ana dih a, nungahnu khu nungah siengthou ahina akimu sih leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua nungah khu apa inn kotphungah ahing puidoh ding a, atenna khuo a mipiten suong in aseplia ding uhi, apa inn a kizua a, Israelte lah a silgilou mothuoitah abawl ziehin; tuabangin na lah ua kipat sil gilou na sumang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mi koi ahieiin Pasal neisa numei aluppi akimu leh alupkhawmpi pasalpa leh numeinu ani un ashi tei tei ding uh ahi. Hichibangin Israelte laha kipat gitlouna silte na sumang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Nungah siengthou mi zi dinga kikhamlai, mi khat in khopi sunga amu a, aluppi leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ani un, tua khopi kulkot bul ah na hing puidoh ding ua, suongin na seplia ding uhi; nungahnu khopi sunga um ngal a akikoulou ziehin tualeh apasal pen a innvengpa zi asuhminsiet ziehin, tambangin na lah ua pat silgilou na koimang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Hinanleh mikhat in mi zikham lai gamlah a amu a, apawng suol a aluppi leh aluppi pasalpa maimai ashi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh nungahnu pen bangma na law lou ding uh ahi, nungahnu tungah shina khop khelna a um sih hi. Aziehpen mi khat in a innveng amuonsuom a, atha toh kibang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aziehpen tua mipan gamlah a ava tuohkha ahia, mi zi ding kikhamsa nungah khu akikou vangin panpi ding a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Mi koi ahiei in nungah koima kham nailou amu a, amat a, a utlou sasa a alupkhawmpi akimuleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amanu luppipa’n nungahnu pa kungah, dangka shekel sawmnga ape dinga, amanu zi in anei ding hi, asuh minsiet ziehin, adam sungin akikhenpi thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Mi’n apa zi akitenpi ding ahi sih a, tualeh apa zi nih zong alem pieh ding ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mi achiltang keh leh aneitah tan khu Mangpa mite kikhopna ah apanlou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Zawlta pouma Mangpa mite kikhopna ah apang thei sih ding ua, ahah asuon akhang sawmna dongin, Mangpa mite kikhopna ah apan lou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ammon mi ahiei, Moabmi ahiei zong Mangpa mite kikhopna ah atellou ding uh ahi, akhang sawmna tandongin Mangpa mite kikhopna ah a pan lou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Izipt gam a kipata na hing pawtdoh lai un tanghou leh tuiin ahing na dawn sih ua, tualeh Mesopotamia gam a Pethor khuo a Beor tapa Balaam noute gausap dinga agoi zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa na Pasian un Balaam thugen apom nuom sih a, Mangpa na Pasian un nou ahing it ziehin, Mangpa na Pasian un tua hamsiet khu nou a dingin guolzawlna asuohsah zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na damsung teng uh, amautoh kilepna leh alam zanna ding uh na ngaituo pieh ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Edom mite na huot ding uh ahi sih a, na unaute uh ahi zaw uhi, Izipt mite zong na huot louding uh ahi, aziehpen agam uah mikhuol nana hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahah asuonte uh, khang thumna kipat in, Mangpa mite kikhopna lah ah apang theita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Na galte uh dou dinga nava giehna mun uah, sil hoilou chinteng lah apat na kihep khiet ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Na lah ua mi koizong zan chienga ama akipat sil pawt zieha thanghuoi na um u’leh giehphuol apat apawtdoh dinga, giehphuol a alut kia nawn lou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh hichi ahi dinga, nitahlam chiengin tui in akisil dinga, nitum chiengin giehphuol ah ahing lut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Giehphuol pulam ah dailenna mun khat na nei ding ua, tuamun ah nava pei zel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh na vanzah lah uah lei taw theina ding chiengpum na kipuoh ding ua, tuamin na dailenna ding uh lei na tou ding ua, nathah zou chiengun na vua kia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh nouma hunkhe ding leh na galte uh na khut ua hing pe dingin, na giehphuol lai uah avah koi hi, tuaziehin na giehphuol uh asienthou ding ahi, tua chilouin na lah ua sil sienglou Amu dinga ahing kiheimangsan kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Apu hing taisan suoh na kung ua ahing tun leh, apu kunga na nua pieh kia ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama dinga hoi adeitelna mun ah, na lah uah ateng dinga; na nuoisie lou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Israel tanute lah ah kizua a um ding ahisih a, tualeh Israel tapate lah ah zong, pasal kizua a um ding uh ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kizuana man ahiei leh uiman man ahiei khu Mangpa na Pasian uh inn a thuchiemna dinga, na tawi ding uh ahi sih, tamte aniin Mangpa na Pasian ua dingin sil kidahhuoi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Apung umin na unaute na leitawi sah ding ahi sih a, sum pung ahiei, bulebal pung ahiei, sil zousie apung del a na palah sah lou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gamdang mite amet um dingin na leitawi sah thei ding ua, hinanleh na unaute pen amet dinga na leitawisah ding uh ahisih hi, tuachi’n na valuo ding uh gam a na khut nasep nate zousie uah, Mangpa na Pasian un ahing guolzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mangpa na Pasian u’kunga thu na chiem u’leh hunsawt hallou a na pieh pai ding uh ahi, aziehpen Mangpa na Pasian un ahing phul ngeingei ding ahi ngal a, tua khu nou a dingin khelna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuchiem lam sanga na kideh u’leh nou a ding in gitlouna ahi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na kam ua pawtsa pen na bawl tei tei ding uh ahi, ut thua sillat na kam ua na chiemsa uh, Mangpa na Pasian u’kunga na chiem dungzui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Na innvengte grep huona na vah chiengun, na dei zaza uh na ne thei ding uhi, a hivangin na seu sung ua na guon ding uh ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na innvengte uh bulei a navah chiengun, buvui na dei zaza uh na khut un na hiet thei ding ua hinanleh buvui dinglaite koite a na at louding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mi khat in zi a pui a, akitenpi a, amanu sienlouna bang ahiei khat amu zieha, amit atun sihleh, hichi ahi dinga, kikhulna lai agel pieh dinga, akhut ah ape ding a, a inn a pat asawldoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh a inn apat apawtdoh nua chiengin pasal dang anei thei kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh a pasal nukhia penin amuda a, kikhulna lai agel pieh a, akhut a apieh a a inn a pat asawldoh leh, ahisihleh apasal nukhia pen ashi a ahileh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a pasal masa amanu khul masa pa’n asuhthang huoisa ahi ziehin akitenpi kia theinawn sih ding hi, Mangpa a dingin sil kidahhuoi ahia, Mangpa na Pasian un goutan ding a ahing pieh gam ah khelna na lutsah lou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Mi zi neichil a um leh galkap a akuon ding ahi sih a, bangma nna semdinga phut ding zong ahi sih, a inn ah kum khat a ut bang bangin a um ding a, azi toh nuomsa tah a, a um ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mi koiman mi sumheh anuoilam ahiei, atunglam ahiei, leibamana ahentang lou ding ahi, mi hinna hentang pieh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mi koi ahiei in a unau Israel tate koi ahiei khat a guh a suoh leh sal bawla abawl ahiei, azua ahiei, akimatdoh leh tua gutapa khu a shi ding ahi; tuabang in na lah ua pat silgilou na koimang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Phaa natna hii tungtang thu ah hoitah a, etchien a, Levi siempute hing hil banga bawl dingin pilvang un; amaute thu ka pieh bangin pilvang tahin na bawl ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Izipt gam a kipata nahing pawtdoh lai ua, lampi a, Mangpa na Pasian un Mirriam tunga abawl dan thei zing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Na unaute bang ahiei khat na leitawisah chiengin akhamna la dingin a inn sunga nava lut ding ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Inn pulam ah na ding dinga, na leitawisahpan khamna khu inn pulam ah ahing tawidoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amapa migenthei ahileh, akhamna na luppi ding uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abang abang hitaleh, apuon sila a imut thei na ding leh ahing guolzawl theina dingin, tua khamna khu nitum chienga na nuapieh kia ngei ngei ding ahi, tam khu nou a dingin Mangpa na Pasian u’masanga na dihtatna uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Na sem dinga na mi goite uh genthei leh tasamte, na unau uh ahiei, na gam ua na tenna khopi sung ua teng gamdangmi ahiei zong, na bawl gentheilou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asepni mama a alaw na pieh ding uh ahi, niin atumkhum ding ahi sih, aziehpen migenthei ahia alungtang tuanah akoi den kha ding hi; khuchilouin na tungtang uah Mangpa ahan dinga, nou a dingin khelna ahing hi kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tate ziehin pate thalia ahisih ding ua, pate ziehin tate zong thalia ahisih ding uhi, michin amauh khelna chiet zieh a thalup ding ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Gamdang mite leh pa neiloute dihloutah a vai na hawmpieh dinguh ahisih hi; meithai puon zong khamna dinga na lah dinguh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh nang zong Izipt gam ah sal in na tanga, Mangpa na Pasian in tuana pat in ahing tandoh chi na thei ngitnget dinguh ahi, tuaziehin tam silte bawl dingin thu ka hing pie ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Na lou ua bu na at, chiengun, lou lai a buphai na manghilte uh, na nualah kia nawnlou ding uh ahi; tuate khu gamdang mite, pa neiloute, leh meithaite ading ahi ding hi, Mangpa na Pasian un na khut nasep zousie uh ahing guolzawl theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na Olive singte uh na sat chiengun, abate na sat ding uh ahi sih hi, tuate khu gamdang mite, Pa neiloute leh meithaite ading ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na grep huon ua grep na law chiengun, asang na nuasui kia ding uh ahi sih hi; tuate khu gamdang mite, pa neiloute leh meithaite ading ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh nou zong Izipt gam ah, sal in nana taangta uh chi na thei ngitnget ding uh ahi. Tuaziehin tam silte bawl dingin thu ka hing pie ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mite kikaal a kinielbuoina a um a, thukhenna zum a ahing pei u’leh, thukhen miten athu uh ana khen pieh ding ua, midih khu siem atangsah ding ua, migilou khu amawpai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, migiloupa zeptuoh ahileh thukhenpa’n amapa amasangah alum sah dinga, a khelna toh kituoh bangza vei ahiei azep ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sawmli vei azep thei dinga, tuasanga tamzaw ahi thei sih ding hi; akan avala, tuasanga tamzaw azep leh na unaupa uh na zalahsah seng khading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Bawngtal in bu achil laiin akam na kanlou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Sanggamhon aten khawm ua, alah ua mikhat tapa neilou a ashileh, ashipa zi a innsung mi hilou gamdang mi akitenpi thei sih ding a, apasal sanggampa’n aluo dinga, ziin anei dinga; tualeh min asanggampa zi abawl ding ngaina bang atungah abawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, Israelte lah a amin manlouna dingin, atapa pieng masa in a sanggampa shisa min apo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh aman asanggampa zi akitenpi utsih leh asanggampa zi kulpi kotkhah bul a upate kungah ava peitou dinga, ka pasal sanggampa’n Israelte lah. A asanggampa min umsah zel a ut sih a, ka pasal sanggampa bawl ding lawm ka tungah abawl nuom sih hi, achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n a khopi upate un amapa ahan ding ua, ahoupi ding ua, tualeh amapa’n ka kitenpi utsih hi chia apan leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asanggampa zi khu akungah upate mitmu in a hing peitou dinga, akedap asutpieh dinga, amaitang ah achilphit dinga, asanggam innkuon tungding nuomloute tungah, hichi kibawl zel heh achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelte lah ah tam mipa min, akedap ki sutpiehpa innkuon akichita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Mi khat leh khat akihau ua, khatpen pa zi in apasal hunkhe dinga, khatpen pa neitah a amat leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amanu khut na tanpieh ding ua, na hepi vawt lou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Na ip sungah tena suong tuom tuom agih leh ajang tena na nei ding uh ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na innsung uah tena chi tuom tuom alien leh a neu na nei lou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh tena dihtah leh kituohtah na nei ding ua, van gih tena kituohtah zong na nei ding uh ahi, tuachi’n Mangpa na Pasian un ahing pieh gam a na damsung nite uh a sawt theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hichibanga sil bawlte leh dihtatlou tah a bawl mi zousie, Mangpa na Pasian ua ding in sil kidahhuoi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Izipt gam a na hing pawtna lampi ua, Amalek ten ahingna bawldan uh thei zing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pasian zong giinglou a, na gim laitah u’leh na basap laitah ua, lampi a ana hing doudan u’leh, a nukhiate leh na nua ua hing pha zouloute ang na suom dante uh theizing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa na Pasian un, na luoding ua ahing piehna gam a, na kimvel ua na galte zousie lah ua kipata, galmuonga khawldamna ahing pieh hun chieng in, vannuoi apat Amalek thei zingna khu na phietmang ding uh ahi, na manghil ding uh ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, Mangpa na Pasian un na goutan ding ua, ahing pieh gam a na hing tun ua, na luo ua, tualeh a sunga naten chiengun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un ahing piehna gamleitang ga tung masapen chiet uh na hing tawi ding ua, seu sungah na koi ding ua, Mangpa na Pasian un amin um na dinga ahing aguot pieh ding mun ah na pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh khum hun lai a um siempu kungah na va pei ding ua, akungah, Mangpa’n ipulepate kunga pieh dinga ana chiem gam ah ka hing tungta chi tuni’n Mangpa na Pasian kungah ka phuongdohta hi, na chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh siempupa’n na khut a pat seu khu ala dinga Mangpa na Pasian maitam masangah akoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tualeh nouten Mangpa na Pasian uh masangah, ka pu uh Asiria mi beimang ding kuon khat vahvai ana hia, Izipt gam ah apeisuh a, ava tenga, tawmnoukhat ahi ua, tualeh khummun ah nam thupitah, silbawltheitah leh tamtah ahing hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh Izipt miten ahing bawlsie ua, ahing sugenthei ua, nasep hasa tahtah ahing semsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa ipulepate Pasian i han ua, Mangpa’n i aw uh ana za a, igenthei dante, isepgim dante, nuoisie a i umdante amu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Izipt a kipat in, khut hattahte, banzahte silzauhuoitahte, chiemtenate, sillamdangte, in ahing pui doh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam munah ahing puilut a, tam gam nawitui leh khuoizu luonna gam ahing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh tuin ngaivawi, Aw Mangpa, Nangman na hing pieh gam a leiga masapente chiet ka hing tawi uhi, na chi ding uhi. Tuachi’n Mangpa na Pasian uh masangah nava lui ding ua, Mangpa na Pasian uh bie in amasangah na kun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa na Pasian un nouma leh na innkuonpite u’leh Levimite leh na lah ua um gamdangmite kunga sil hoi ahing pieh zousiete ziehin nuomsa tahin na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tualeh kum thumna kum, sawma khat piehna kum a na sil tung zousie uh sawma khat na hing luikhawm ua, tualeh Levi mite, gamdang mite, pa neiloute leh meithaiten, na umna huong sung ua, a neh ua a tai theina ding ua na pieh zou chieng un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian uh masangah; na hing thupieh, na thupieh zousie dungzui in, ka inn ua kipat asiengthou sawma khatte ka koidoh ua, Levimite, gamdangmite, pa neiloute leh meithaite kungah ka peta uhi; tualeh na thupiehte khat beeh zong ka palse sih ua, manghil zong ka manghil sih uhi, na chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka da lai un tuate ka ne sih ua, ka bua lai un zong ka zangthang sih uhi, tualeh mishi dingin zong ka pe sih uhi. Mangpa ka Pasian uh, aw ka ngaikhe zing ua, na hing thu pieh zousie bangin ka bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na umna siengthou van a kipat in hing ensuh inlen, nawitui leh khuoizu luonna gam, ka pule pate uh kung a pieh ding a na kichiemsa bangin, na mi Israelte leh na gam hing piehsa guolzawl in, nachi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tuni’n Mangpa na Pasian un tam dan thupiehte leh vaihawmna dante zui dingin thu ahing pie hi; tuaziehin na lungtang zousie u’leh na hinna zousie un na pom un na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuni’n nouten Mangpa khu na Pasian uh hi ding leh alampi zui a, athupiehte, adanthute leh avaihawmna dante zui a, a aw te ngaikhe dingin na telta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh ahing thuchiemsa bangin, leh a thupieh zousie na zui na dingun, Mangpa’n tuni’n noute Ama atuom, Amite hi dingin ahing teldoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ana gentah mabangin, Mangpa na Pasian ua dinga nam siengthou, na hing hi theina ding u’leh, nam a abawl zousie tunga sangtah a, pahtawina, minthanna leh zatathuoi nahi theina dingun Mangpa’n ahing telta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi leh Israel upaten, mipite kung ah thu apie ua, “Tunia ka hing thupieh zousie zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un ahing pieh ding gam a teng ding a Jordan na kan ni chiengun, hichi ahi ding a, suong lienpipi na phut ding ua, suonglou in na zut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh na galkai zou chiengun tua suongte tungah tam danthute zousie na giel ding uhi, tuachi’n Mangpa napu leh pate uh Pasian in pieh dinga ana chiemsa bangin nawitui leh khuoizu luonna gam Mangpa na Pasian un ahing pieh gamah na pei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin Jordan na kan zou chiengun hichi ahi ding a, tunia phu ding a thu ka hing pieh tam suongte khu Ebal muol ah na phut ding ua, suonglou in na zut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh khummun ah Mangpa na Pasian ua dingin maitam, suong maitam na bawl ding ua; atung uah sia vanzah mawngmawng na zah dinguh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh maitam khu suong kikhenglou in na bawl ding ua, atungah Mangpa na Pasian ua dingin halmang sillatte na lan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh lemna sillatte na lan ding ua, khummun ah na ne ding ua, Mangpa na Pasian uh masangah nuomtahin na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh suongte tungah, tam dan thute zousie kichientahin na giel ding uhi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi leh Levi siemputen Israel tate zousie a houpi ua, akung uah, “Israel tate aw pilvangtah in ngaikhie un, tuni’n Mangpa na Pasian uh mite na hing hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa na Pasian uh thu na manding uh ahi, tunia ka hing thupieh, athupiehte leh adanthute na zui ding uh ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in khumni ma in mipite thu apie a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Jordan gal na hingkai chiengun mipite guolzawl dingin tam namte Gerizim muol tungah ading diing uhi: Simeon namte, Levi namte, Juda namte Issakar namte, Joseph leh Benjamin namte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh hamselaw dingin tam namte Ebal muol tung ah ading ding uhi: Reuben namte, Gad namte, Asher namte, Zebulun namte, Dan namte leh Naphtali namte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Leviten Israel mi zousie kungah, aw ngaitahin thu agen ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mi khutsiemte siemna a kibawl, Mangpa a dinga kidahhuoi milim khenthu ahiei, sunthu ahiei, bawla koidap pouma hamsiet in um heh achi ding ua; Mipi zousie’n Amen a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Anu ahiei, apa ahiei, zatatlou pouma hamsiet um heh, achi ding ua. Mipi zousie’n Amen achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“A innvengte gamgi suonmi hamsiet in um heh chi ding ua. Mipi zousie’n Amen, chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Lampi a kipata mitto lampi hilou a, peisah pouma hamsiet in um heh achi ding ua. Mipi zousien, Amen, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Gamdang mite, Pa neiloute leh meithaite dihloutah a vaihawm pieh mi, hamsiet in um heh, achi ding ua Mipi zousie’n Amen, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Apa zi luppi mi hamsiet in um heh apa lupna zatatlou ahi ziehin achi ding ua. Mipi zousie’n Amen, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ganta khat pou pou toh lumkhawm mi hamsiet in um heh a chi ding ua. Mipi zousie’n Amen, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“A sanggamnu apa tanu ahiei, anu tanu ahiei luppimi hamsiet in um heh achi ding ua, Mipi zousien Amen achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Asungnu luppi pouma hamsiet in um heh achi ding ua. Mipi zousie’n Amen, chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“A innvengte that dap mi hamsiet in um heh achi ding ua, Mipi zousie’n Amen, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Mawna neilou thana dinga golguhna la pouma hamsiet in um heh achi ding ua. Mipi zousie’n Amen, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tam dan thupieh zousie zuidinga pomkip lou pouma hamsiet in um heh achi ding ua. Mipi zousie’n Amen, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tualeh hichi ahing hidinga, Mangpa na Pasian aw uh hoitah a na ngaikhieh ua, tunia thu ka hing pieh athupiehte zousie pilvang taha na zui u’leh, Mangpa na Pasian un leitunga nam zousie tunga tungnungpen in ahing bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian uh thu na zui pouma u’leh tam guolzawlna zousie na tung uah ahing um ding a ahing zuizel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khopi sung leh gamsung ah guolzawl in na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na gil ua gate, na leitang gate, na ganhonte, na bawnghonte leh na belamhonte u’zong guolzawlna tangin ahing pung ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na seu u’leh na tanghou mehna hengkuongte uh guolzawl in a um ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na lut u’leh na pawtdoh chiengun zong guolzawl in na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mangpa’n nouma hingdou dinga kipan na melmate uh na masang uah ahing zaw pieh dinga, nou hing dou dingin lampi khat ah ahing kuon ding ua, na masang uah lampi sagi ah ataizah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa’n na annbuhte u’leh na khut nasepna zousie tung uah, guolzawlna thu ape ding a, Mangpa na Pasian un ahing pieh gam ah ahing guolzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh thupiehte na pom ua, alampite na zui pou u’leh, na kung ua akichiemtah mabangin, Mangpa’n noute Ama ading a nam siengthouin a hing sukip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n leitunga nam zousie’n, Mangpa mina hatdoh na hi uh chi athei ding ua, ahing giing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n nouma pieh dinga napu leh pate uh kunga ana chiem gamah, na gil ua gate, na ganhon pungte u’leh na leitang gate uah, nasatahin ahing supung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa’n na gam uh ahun huna, guotui pe ding leh na khut nasep zousie uh hing guolzawl dingin, van a a goubawm hoite akihong sah dinga; tuachi’n nam tampi na leitawi sah ding ua, nou vangin na leitawi ngai sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Tunia ka hing thu pieh, Mangpa na Pasian uh thupiehte pilvang taha na zui u’leh, Mangpa’n noute alu in ahing pangsah dinga, a mei ahing hisah sih ding hi, na khangtou ding ua nakiem ngai sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh tunia ka hing thupiehte apat zietlam ahiei, veilam ahiei a na piel sih ua, pasien dangte nna sem dinga na zui sih pou u’leh, khumbangin na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Hinanleh hichi ahing ahidinga, tunia ka hing pieh athupieh zousie pilvang tah a zui ding a, Mangpa na Pasian aw na ngaikhieh sih u’leh, tam hamsietna zousie na tung uah ahing tung dinga, ahing phazui zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa’n na khopite u’leh na lougamte uh sapsiet atangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na seute u’leh na tanghou mehna kuongte uh hamsietin a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na talenaute u’leh na gam gate u’leh na ganhonte uh, tualeh na belamhon punglaite uh, sapsiet in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na hing lut chieng un sapsiet in na um ding ua, na pawtdoh chieng un zong sapsiet in na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Mangpa’n na tung uah leh, na khut nasep na zousie uah sapsiet na leh lungkiehnate ahing tungsah dinga, tualeh na silbawl giloute zieh ua kei na hing ngaisahlou nate ziehun, na guollel ding ua na mangthai pai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Luo dinga na lutna gam ua kipat ahing suhmang masangsie’n, Mangpa’n natna hii ahing vomsah ngitnget ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mangpa’n kumzawnnate, khosih natnate, chipawmna te, chisatna zauhuoite, namsaute, gawnnate leh muotna te, in ahing gawt dinga, na manthai masangsie uh ahing del zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na tunglam ua van khu sum-eng asuohsah dinga, na umna leitung u’zong sia a suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mangpa’n na gam guotuite uh leivui leh vutvai asuoh sah dinga, na manthai masangsie uh, van a kipat in na tung uah ahing kesuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Mangpa’n na galte uh masangah ahing guollel sah dinga, na galte uh dou dingin lampi khat ah na kuonkhe ding ua, amasang uah lampi sagi ah na taikeh ding uhi, tualeh leitung namchin zousie lah ah, nam chizat huoi leh liengvai na hi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh na luongte uh tunga leeng vate leh gamsa zousie ann ahi dinga, koiman adelmang sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Suhdam theilou Izipt gam vohpi uilutte, chibawte, vun ngotnate, chipawmnate, tualeh uithahte in Mangpa’n ahing gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mangpa’n mot nate, mittawtnate leh lungsim buoinate’n ahing gawt dinga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mittaw miel lah a akimaimaw bangin noute zong suntang laiin na kimaimaw ding ua, tualeh na lamzang ngai sih ding ua, tualeh nuoisie leh gallah ding bep na hi ding ua, koiman ahing hundoh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zi ding numei na khaam ding ua, mi dangin aluppi ding ua, inn na lam ding ua na teng sih ding ua, grep huon na bawl ding ua, aga na ne sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na mitmu un na bawngtalte uh akithat dinga, hinanleh asa na ne kha sih ding uhi, na maitang ua kipat na sabiltungte uh ahing kilah pieh dinga, ahing kipe kia nawn sih ding hi, na belamte u’zong na melmate uh pieh ahi dinga, nou hing panpi ding koima a um sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na tapate, na tanute uh nam dang mite kunga pieh ahi ding ua, sunnitumin amaute ngaiin na en ngetngut ding ua, na et et nalam un na mitte uh avai dinga, na khut ah bangma bawltheina mawngmawng na nei nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na gam gate u’leh na sepgim ga zousie uh, na thei ngailou uh namten ane zou sieng ding ua, noute pen nuoisie ding leh engbawl ding bep na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n na mit ua khum silte na mu ziehun na motlaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mangpa’n na khupte uah, na kengte uah suhdamtheilou uilut, na kengtaw ua kipat na jangsip tan un ahing veisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Nou leh na leengpa nangawn u’leh, napu leh pate tan ua, na thei khah ngailou uh namte kung ah, Mangpa’n ahing pui dinga, khunah sing leh suonga kibawl pasien dangte nna nasem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n ahing puimangna ding nam zousiete lah ah, nam chizat huoi leh paunah leh aselam gentena na hing hita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Na lou uah haichi tampi na tu ding ua, hinanleh tawmnoukhat nala ding uhi, khauphe in aneh zou ding zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Grep huon na bawl ding ua, na kem ding ua, hinanleh grep zu na dawn kha sih ding ua, grep ga zong na lou khatuom sih ding uhi, lungin aneh zou ding zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Na gamsung zousie uah Olive sing na suon ding ua hinanleh athau na kinu sih ding uhi, agate apul sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tapate, tanute na nei ding ua hinanleh nou a ahi sih ding ua, suoh leh sal a puimangin a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Na theikung zousie u’leh na gam hawsuoh leigate uh khauphe in ane gam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Na lah ua gamdangmi umte noute sangin asang zaw vahiei ding ua, noute pen na ngiem suh deu deu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A hing leitawi sah ding ua, nouten na leitawi sah sih ding uhi; amaute alu ahi ding ua, noute pen amei na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuaban ah, tam samsietna zousiete na tung uah ahing tung ding a, ahing nuadel dinga, ahing pha zui zel ding hi; suhmanga na um masangsie un, azieh pen athupiehte leh athugousie zui dingin Mangpa na Pasian uh aw pilvangtahin na ngaikhe sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tualeh tuate khu nou leh na hah nasuonte uh tungah kumtawna dinga chiemtena leh sil lamdang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />“Sil zousie a na hing kiningchin zieh ua, Mangpa na Pasian uh nna lungsim kipah tah leh lungnuom tah a nasep lou zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Nouma hing dou dinga Mangpa’n ahing sawlding na melmate uh na gilkiel pumin leh dangtah pumin tualeh saguoh pumin leh sil bangkim a tasam pumin naseppieh dinga, ahing suhmangthai masangsie un na ngawng ah sia hahkol ahing posah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Mangpa’n nouma dou dingin gamlapi kawlmong a kipat in nam khat, muvanlai banga gang, a ham uh na thei ngailou dinguh nam khat ahing sawlding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Nam giinhuoi melpuo, tehsie zong khawhsalou, khanglaite zong deisah tuomlou;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tualeh na ganhonte u’leh na hawsuoh leigate uh na manthai masangsie uh ahing nehpieh ding ua, tualeh ahing suhmangthai masangsie un na bute uh, na uoin thate uh, na sathaute uh, na ganhon pungte uh leh na belamnoute uh ahing khawipieh sih ding ua, na manthai masangsie uh ane ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Na gam pumpi ua na muon pen uh na kulpi sang pen uh achipmang masangsie’n, na kulkotpi zousie uah ahing im ding ua, Mangpa na Pasian un nou ahing pieh na gam sung zousie ua, na kulkotpi zousie uah ahing im khum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Na galte un ahing imchimit zieh ua, neh leh tah ding neilou a nalungkham seng ziehun, Mangpa na Pasian un ahing pieh na tapate u’leh na tanute uh sa na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Na lah ua mi umdan hoileh pha penpenten zong asanggampate uh, akawilai azi deimamate u’leh a ang sung ua apomlai ata it mamate nasan zong neh ding in a enla ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Bangma anei nawnlou zieh un atate uh sa ane ding ua, koima ahawm utsih ding uhi, na galte un na kulpite uh a imchimit ua, na kulpi kotpite zousie uh khakhuma ahing imtawmtah zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Na lah ua numei chinou leh chingeh tah, achinou u’leh achingeh zieh ua lei zong akeng ua tuon nuomlou ten zong a ang ua lumlai apasal it mamate u’leh atanu leh atapa it mamate u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Apom lai uh ata ngehsen leh ata pieng nalai dingte u’zong a enla ding ua, sil zousie a tahsap siengtah ziehun anedap ding uhi; na galte un na khopi kulpi kotpite zousie ua panga ahing imchimit a, ahing imtawm ua na chimaw sengtah ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />“Mangpa Na Pasian uh min thupitah leh zauhuoitah na giin thei na ding ua, tam laibu a kigiel thu zousie pilvang tah a na zui sih u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Mangpa’n nouma leh nahah nasuonte uh tungah natna hi lamdang thoidam theilou leh natna damtheilou leh huoisie leh chizat huoi ang tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tualeh na giin mama uh Izipt gam natna ahing tungsah dinga, ahing nuasie ngainawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tualeh natna chinteng tam laibu a kigiel khalou natna hiite zong, na manthai masangsie un, Mangpa’n na tung uah atungsah nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tuachi’n van a aasi banga tam hina’n ulachin tawmnoukhat na hing hita ding uhi, Mangpa na Pasian uh aw na man lou zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi dinga, nouma bawl hoi ding leh supung dinga, Mangpa na tung ua akipah mabang in, nouma sumang ding leh suse dingin Mangpa akipah dinga, na valuo ding uh gam na lutna ua kipat suonmang na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n noute kawlmong langkhat akipat alelam tan in, nam zousie lah ah ahing thethang dinga, khunah noute leh napu napate un zong athei ngailou uh pasien dang, sing leh suongte nna nasep pieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tualeh tam namte lah ah tawldamna mawngmawng na mu sih ding ua, na kengtaw un zong tawldamna amu sih ding hi, hinanleh Mangpa’n lungdonna, mitgimna, lungsim a kingamlana, a hing pezaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Tualeh na hinna uh patau ngitnget in a um dinga sun leh zan in na zau ngitnget ding ua, na hinna un kithei chienna anei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Zingmawng chiengin nitah hitaleh aw nachi ding ua, nitah chiengin zingmawng hitaleh aw! na chi ding uhi; shi zauhuoina na lungtang un a giin ding zieh leh na mit ua na sil mu dingte uh zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Na kung ua, na mu kia nawn sih ding uh chia ka gensa lampi ah, Mangpa’n noute Izipt gam ah tembawin ahing nua sawl kia dinga, tuachi’n khum gam a na melmate uh suohpa leh suohnu dingin na kizuading ua, hinanleh koiman ahing lei nuom sih ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tamte khu Horeb muol a amautoh abawl thuhun chilou Mangpa’n Moab gam a Israel tate kunga bawl dinga Mosi kunga thu apieh thuhun thute tamte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Israel mipite zousie ahankhawm a a kung uah, “Izipt gam a Pharaoh tung leh agamsung pumpi tunga na mitmu ua Mangpa’n abawl zousie na muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ze et na thupi tahtahte, chiemtenate, sillamdangte, na mit ngei ua na mute uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n tuni tandongin theisiemna lungtangte, mu theina mitte leh zahtheina bilte, ahing pe nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gamdai ah kum sawmli sung vingveng ka hing puita a, na satung ua na puonsilte uh ase sih a, na keng ua na kengdapte uh zong ase sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei khu Mangpa na Pasian uh kahi chi na hing theina dingun, tanghou na ne sih ua, uoin ahiei, zu chia ahiei zong na dawn nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh tam mun na hing tun un Heshbon leengpa Sihon leh Bashan leengpa Og eite dou dingin ahing kuon ua, amaute ina zouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh agam uh ila ua, Reuben mite, Gad mite leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte kung ah aluo dingun ipeta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin na silbawl zousie ua na lamzan theina dingun tam thuhun thute pom unlen zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tuni’n na unpi un Mangpa na Pasian uh masangah na phung lamkaite uh, na upate u’leh, na houtute uh, tualeh Israel mipite zousie leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na taneute uh, na zite uh, tualeh na giehphuol sung ua um gamdang mi na singtomte u’leh na tui tawi ua pangte nangawn toh na ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tunia Mangpa na Pasian un noute toh kikaal a abawl Mangpa na Pasian uh thuhun leh akichiemna a na lut theina ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Napu leh pate uh Abraham, Isaak leh Jakob te kunga ana kichiem bang leh na kung ua a gensa banga, tunia noute amite dinga ahing suhdet theina ding leh Ama khu na Pasian uh ahitheina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam thuhun leh kichiemna khu nou kung guoh a bawl ka hisih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh tunia Mangpa i Pasian uh masanga, idinpite leh tunia ikung ua umloute toh zong ka bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Izipt gam a ina tendante, namdangte palsan a ipei suoh dante na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh alah ua um sil kidahhuoi abawlte u’leh sing leh suong, sana leh dangka a, abawl uh amilimte u’zong na mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khuchilouinvang na lah ua pasal ahiei, numei ahiei, innkuon ahiei, phung ahiei, khum namte pasiente be ding leh ana uh sem dingin na lungtang un tuin Mangpa i Pasian uh kiheisan in na lah uah sil kha leh gamsai seldohna zungte ahing um kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh khuchi ahia, tam samsietna thute azah nua a dangtana-a, azukhamna belap dinga, ka lungtang ngaituona dandan in um nanleng lungmuonna ka nei ve ve ding, chia alungtanga akiguolzawl tup leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa’n ama akhawi sih dinga, tuathamlouin Mangpa lungthahna leh thangsietna in atungah akuong ding hi, tualeh tam laibu a kigiel hamse zousie atungah atung dinga, Mangpa’n vannuoi apat in amin aphietmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n ama khu tam dan laibu a kigiel hamsietna thuhun zousie dungzuiin Israel phung zousie lah apat silgilou tang dingin akhentuom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n na nua chieng ua khangtha hing pieng zel ding na tate u’leh, gamlapi a kipata gamdangmi hing pei dingten Mangpa’n khum gam tunga akoi gawtna hii leh natna aveisahte amu chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Agam pumpi kaatsuong leh chikhal gam, kahgawna leh haichi tutheilouna, tualeh sing leh loupa pou louna, gam kieu Mangpa’n alungthah thangpai ni a asuhsiet Sodom leh Gomorrah, Admah leh Zeboiim abawl banga, a bawl amutah chiengun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nam zousieten zong bang zieha tam gam Mangpa’n tambang talawm a abawl adiei? Hichi talawma thangpaina meibanga kuongdoh va-ia bang chidan adiei? achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n miten Izipt gam a kipat a apuidoh lai a apulepate uh Pasian in amaute toh athuhun amanghil zieh uh ahi achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aziehpen nidanga athei ngailou u’leh Mangpa’n aphal vawtlou pasien dangte bie a ana uh asep pieh zieh uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaziehin tam laibu sunga kigiel hamsie zousie hing tungsah dingin, Mangpa lungthahna khu tam gam tungah akuongdoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh tunia abawl bangin, Mangpa’n amaute agam ua kipat in lungthahna leh thangpaina mama toh gamdang ah anot mangta hi, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Sil kiphuolte khu Mangpa i Pasian a ahi a, hinanleh sil kilangte pen tam danthute zousie izui theina ding ua kumtawna eite leh ihah isuonte ua ahi ngitnget ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tualeh hichi ahing hi dinga, na masang ua ka koi tam guolzawlna leh hamsietnate zousie na tung ua ahing tun a, tualeh Mangpa na Pasian un ahing thethangna nam zousie lah ah tuate na hing theidoh kia ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian kunga na hing kile kia ua, tunia thu kahing pieh dungzui a, nou leh na tate utoh na lungtang zousie u’leh na hinna zousie ua athu na zui hun chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian un na saltaanna uh ahing suhbei pieh dinga, ahing hepi dinga, Mangpa na Pasian un ahing thethangna nam zousiete lah a kipat ahing puikhawm kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lah ua mi koi ahiei vantawp tanna gamla a delmang aum u’leh Mangpa na Pasian un khuna kipat in ahing puikhawm ding a, khuna kipat in ahing ladoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa na Pasian un napu leh pate un aluo gam uah, ahing puilut kia dinga na luo ding uhi, Aman ang lamzang sah dinga, napu leh pate uh khupin ahing pungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh na hin theina dingun Mangpa na Pasian uh na lungtang zousie leh na hinna zousie ua na it theina ding un, Mangpa na Pasian un na lungtang u’leh na hahnasuonte uh lungtang tep ahing atanpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian un tam hamsete zousie khu na melmate u’leh nou hing muda leh hing sugentheite tung ah atungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh na hing kihei kia ding ua, Mangpa na Pasian thu na hing zuita ding ua, tunia thu ka hing pieh athupiehte zousie na bawlta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa na Pasian un, nasep nabawl zousie uah, nagil ua gate uah, na ganhonte uah leh na gam gate uh nasatah in ahing supung ding hi; napu leh pate uh tunga akipah bang in Mangpa na tung uah akipah kiata ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam dan laibu a kigiel athupiehte leh athugousiete zui dinga Mangpa na Pasian uh aw na ngaikhieh ua, na lungtang zousie u’leh na hinna zousie utoh Mangpa na Pasian uh lam na ngat kia phot u’leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tam athupieh tunia ka hing pieh, nou adinga sil lamdang kiphuol ahi sih a, gamlapi a um zong ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koi ahiei eite a dinga van a kaltou a, izah theina ding u’leh, ibawl theina ding ua ikung ua hing puohsuh ding, na chi ding ua van a um ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahisihleh, izah theina ding u’leh ibawl theina ding ua koi ahiei tuipi gal a hing vagalkai pieh a, hing valah pieh ding? na chi ding ua, tuipi gal a um zong ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh na zui theina dingun thuin ahing nai mama a, na kam u’leh na lungtang ua um ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“En in, tuni’n na masangah hinna leh hoina, tualeh shina leh sietna ka koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh it dinga, alampite zui dinga, tualeh athupiehte leh adanthute leh avaihawmna dante pom dinga tunia ka hing thupiehte na zui u’leh na hing ding ua, na pung ding ua, na valuo ding gam uah Mangpa na Pasian un ahing guolzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh ngaikhe nuom lou dinga, na lungtang uh akiheimanga, puimanga na um ua, Pasian dangte na bieh ua, anate nasep u’leh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na mangthang teitei ding uh chi tuni’n ka hing hil ahi; Jordan lui galkai a luo dinga na valutna gam uah na dam sawt sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na masang uah hinna leh shina, guolzawlna leh hamsie ka koi hi chi tuni’n na tungtang thu ua theipi ding in lei leh van ka han hi; tuaziehin noute leh nahah nasuonte uh na hin theina dingun hinna tel un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh na it ua, athu na man ua, ama a na kiluoi bembom ngitnget na dingun, ama lah na hinna u’leh na damsawtna uh ahi thuoi a, tuachi’n napu leh pate uh Abraham, Isaak leh Jakob kunga pieh dinga akichiemna gam ah na teng thei ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Israel mipite zousie kungah tam thute agen a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh aman akung uah, “Tuin kum za leh sawmni ka hita a, vaikuon leh vaitung zou ding ka hi nawn sih hi, tualeh Mangpa’n Jordan luigal kailou ding na hi, ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh na masang uah apei dinga, na masang ua kipat tam namte ahing suhmang pieh dinga, agam uh na luo ding ua, tualeh Mangpa’n agen tahmabangin Joshua in na mauh apuita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n asuhmang Amormite gam leh aleengte uh Sihon leh Og tunga abawl bang in atung uah abawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa’n amaute na khut uah ahing pe ding a, thu ka hing pieh thupieh zousie dungzuiin atung uah na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hattah leh hangsantahin um unlen, zau sih unlen amaute giing sih un, aziehpen Mangpa na Pasian uh noute toh zawhkhawm ahia, ahing nuasie sih dinga, ahing taisan sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in Joshua ahan a, Israelte zousie mitmu ah “Hattah leh hangsantahin um inlen aziehpen Mangpa’n apulepate uh kunga pieh dinga achiemna gam ah tam mite na zawpi dinga amaute na luosah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa khu na masang ah apei dinga, Aman ahing umpi dinga, ahing nuasie sih dinga, ahing peisan sih ding hi, zau sinlen, lunglel vawt sin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in tam dan agiel a, Levi tate siempute leh Mangpa thuhun bawm zawngte kung leh Israel upate zousie kungah apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in amaute thu apie a, “Kum sagi kum ngaidamna kumtenga hampheng pawi bawlna a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israelte zousie Mangpa Pasian masanga a kilat na ding ua, Mangpa’n aguot mun a ahing kilat chiengun Israelte zousie zah dingin na sim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipite numei, pasal leh naupangte tualeh na kulpi huongsung ua um gamdang miten a zah ua, azil ua, Mangpa na Pasian uh zaudan asiem ua, tami thute zousie pilvang tah a azui theina ding u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Atate uh a thei nailouten zong azah ua, Jordan luigal kan a na valuo ding uh gam a na ten sungsie ua Mangpa na Pasian uh giin dan asiem ua, a kizil theina dingun han khawmin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi kungah, “Ngai in, na shi hun ahing naita, Joshua han inlen kimutuona biehbuh ah vakilang in khunah ama thu ka pe ding hi” achi hi. Tuachi’n Mosi leh Joshua apei ua kimutuona biehbuh ah ava kilangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa khu biehbuh ah meilum khuom in ava kilah a, tualeh meilum khuom khu biehbuh kotpi tungah a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Mosi kungah, “Ngaiin napu leh pate kunga imu ding nahita a, tam mite ahing thou ding ua, ava umna dingte u’lah a, khum gamdang pasiente lah ah akizua ding ua, Kei ahing lengatsan ding ua, amaute toh kikaal a ka thuhun abawtse ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum hun chiengin atung uah ka lungthahna akuongdoh dinga, ka lengatsan dinga, alah ua kipat ka mai ka phuol mangta dinga, nehtum in a umta ding ua, atung uah sietna leh mangbatna tampi atung dinga, tuachi’n khum ni chiengin amauten i Pasian uh ilah ua aumlou zieha tam silgiloute itung ua hing tung hilou ahiei mah? achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khum ni chiengin, pasien dangte lam ngaa a asilgilou bawl zousiete uh ziehin ka mai ka phuol ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin tam la giel inlen Israel tate zilsah in. Israel tate tungtang thu ah, tam la kei a dinga theipitu ahi theina dingin akam uah koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Apu leh pate uh kung a ka na chiem nawitui leh khuoizu luonna gam a ka puilut chiengin, ne le dawn in, atai ding ua, a hing thau chiengun, pasien dangte lam anga ding ua, ana asep pieh ding ua, Kei ahing nuol ding ua, ka thuhun abotse ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing hi dinga, sil hoilou leh mangbatna tampite atung ua ahing tun hun chiengin, tami lain bang zieh a genthei ahi uoi chi theipitu ana hi ding hi; ahah asuonte uh kam a gen mangmaw ahi ding zieh in, tuin ka chiemna gam a ka puilut masang in zong alungsim ngaituona uh a le vah kawi dante uh ka thei zouta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin khum ni mama in Mosi in tam la agielkhie a Israel tate ahilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Nun tapa Joshua ahoupi a, akungah, “Hattah in um inlen kisuhangsan in, pieh dinga ka chiem gam ah Israel tate puilut ding na hi, tualeh keiman kang umpi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahi a, Mosi in tam dan thute laibu sungah agiel zou sienga mansa a akoi diem zou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mosi in Mangpa thuhun bawm zawng Levite thu apie a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tam danbu la unlen, na tungtang thu ua theipitu ahi theina dingin, Mangpa na Pasian uh thuhun bawm gei ah koi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na helhat dan u’leh na paupen dan uh ka thei hi. Ngai un, tu a ka hing dampi lai a bawn, Mangpa tunga hel a kiphin hatte na hi ua, ka shi nua chiengin bang na hing suoh tabep ding uoi izaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Abil ngei ua azah ua tam thute ka gen theina ding leh atungtang thu ua, theipitu dinga lei leh van ka hat theina dingin na phung sung ua upate zousie leh na lamkaite uh hing hankhawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aziehpen ka shi nua chiengin nasetah in na hing kisusegawp ding ua, ka hing thupieh lampi akipat na pielmang ding uh chi ka thei kilkel hi; tualeh atawp lam chiengin sil hoilou in ahing buohkhum dinga, na khut nasep silbawlte zousie zieh un Mangpa na Pasian uh na sulungthah ding ua, amitmu a silhoilou na bawl ding zieh un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi in tami laguite khu adawng tawpna dongin Israel mipi kikhawmten abil ua azah dingun agen sieng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Aw nou vante bil daw in na ngaiun, thu hing gen ding kahi. Tualeh Aw leitungin ka kam a thu pawtte, na ngaikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thuhilnate van guotui bangin azu ding, ka thugente khu daitui bangin atakhe dinga, Loupa hing dipdep tunga guonel phin bang leh, Hampa tunga daitui kie bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa min ka tangkoupi dinga, Thupina i Pasian pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ama suongpi ahia, anasep ahoi bukim hi. Alampite zousie, dihtatna ahi, dihna Pasian leh gen banglou dihtat leh hoi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Atungah na ginum sih ua, Amite chitaah zong na hi sih uhi, Khangthulimlou leh Nam lepchiete na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tambanga Mangpa thuh ding na hi uoi mah, Nou mimo leh pilloute aw. Ama noute hing siempa leh, Nam khat a hing tung dingpa, Na pa uh ahi sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khanglui lai nite thei zing unlen, khang tampi na peisa kumte ngaituo un, Na pate uh dongun, ahing kawhmu ding ua, Na upate uh dong un, tuachi’n atangthu ahing hil ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tungnung sangpen in namte agoutan ding uh, gamte ahawm pieh lai in, Mihing tate a tuom khen lai in, Israel tate atam dan dungzui un Namte gamgi ahunpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa tanvou khu amite ahi ua, Jakob khu agoutan tuom ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman Jakob khu Gamdai gamgaw mun ah amu a, Gamdai huisie mau he hute lah ah akem a, thu ahila, Amit laidum bangin adiem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Muvanlai in abu a anoute atoh thou a, aha zahkhum in anoute tungah aleng a, aha jahin atungah atuong sah kia a, len akizil sah bangin, Mangpa’n Israel pua ding a veng zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa bou khu ahi amite pui, Gamdang mite pasien hilou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman amaute leitung munsangte ah atuongsah a, Lou a siltungte aneh theina ding un, Suongpi akipat khuoizu aluongkhe sah a, Meisa suonga kipat in sathau apawt sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawngpi akipat bawngnawi khalte leh, Belamhonte akipat nawitui, Belamnou thaute toh, Bashan gam belamtalte leh kelte, deituom Mangbu hoipente leh, uoin hoi pente na dawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Hinanleh Jeshurunte ahing thauta ua, Akiphin hat ua, athau ua, na sa uh ahing pha ta, Thaunain ahing tuomta hi. Tuachi’n asiempa Pasian ale ngatsanta ua, Ahundamna suongpi uh angai neuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gamdang pasienten thangsietna atoh thou ua, kidahhuoina in alungthah sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasian hilou dawite kungah, Athei khah ngailou uh pasiente kungah, napu napate un zong ana thei khah ngailou uh, atha a hing kisiemthu pasiente, kung pou ah, akithoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang hing suongpa Suongpi khu Na ngaisah sih a, Nang hing siempa, Pasian na manghilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Tualeh tam khu Mangpa’n amu tahin, atapate u’leh atanute uh suh lungthahna zieh in, amauh amuda tahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Aman amaute akipat, ka mai ka phuol dinga, Bang ahing suoh mawng uoimah, ka enkhe ding hi, khang ginalou leh ginna neilou ahi uh a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pasian hilou silte in ka thangsietna leh, thangpaina ahing toh thou ua, a milim mot huoite un ahing lungthah sah ua, Mipi a simkhamloute zangin, Ka suthangpai dinga, nam pilvang loute zangin, amaute ka sulungthah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka lungthahna meibangin akuong doh a, gawtmun tawdop dongin aka ding a, Leitung leh a sunga um zousie akatum dinga, taang bul kingahnate a halkuong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“A tung uah sietna ka sevum dinga, Atung uah ka thaltang ka kap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gil kielnain amauh amangthai sah dinga, sietna leh natpi in meikuong bangin, akatum ding ua, atung uah gamsa ha hiemte leh, leivui a kithol gul gukhate zong ka sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pulam ah namsau in, sunglam ah chizatna leh zauna in, nungah tangval leh, Naungeh nawitep laite leh tehsie samkangte zong a sumangthai sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Amaute ka thelthang sah dinga, mihing lah akipat amaute theizingna khu, ka phiet mangding chi in ka ngaituo a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A melmate un theikhielin, “I khutte tawisangin a umta, Tamte zousie Mangpa bawl ahi vawtsih, Melma lungthahten chi khava uh, chi zausih leng.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Pilna neilou namte ahi ua, ama uah theisiemna a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw pil u’leh tamte atheisiem ding ua, Atunualam thu uh ngaituo ding hima ve un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bang dinga mi khat in tul khat azaw a, tul sawm mi niin a zaw thei ahiei, Mangpa a Pasian un amaute a nuasie a, Bangkimbawlthei Pasian in amauh, ataisan tah zieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A pasien uh eite Pasian bang ahi sih, chi i melmate nangawn in athei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A grep guite uh Sodom grep gui ahia, Gomorrah gam a ahia, Agrepte uh sinkha grep ahia, aga bomte zong akha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A uointe u’khu dragon gu leh, gulha gupha tah ahia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Khum khu ka kholkhawm ka goubawma, ka bil hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Phulah leh thuh kiana khu kei a ahia, apansia uh ahing teu hun chiengin, a sietna ni uh ahing naita, a tung ua sil hing tung dingte, a hing tung paita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mangpa’n amite vai ahawmpieh dinga, Tualeh ahatna uh abeita a, Khakhum leh nuasie koima a um nawn sih uh, chi amu chiengun, asuohte tungah lainatna aneita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aman a pasiente u’leh, a muon suongpi uh hei a um ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A kithoina thau nete leh, Adawn sillalte uh dawnte, Hing thoudoh u’henlen, hing panpi u’heh nou hing humbittute hi uheh, achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Tuin ngaiun, kei keima mama ka hi, thei unlen pasien dang a um sih uh, Kathatlia a ka suhing zel hi, ka suliema kadamsah zel hi, Ka khut a kipat a la doh thei koima a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Vanlam ah ka khut ka zahtou a, kumtawn a hing ka hi ka chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ka namsau val lihleh ka tat hiema, ka khutin vaihawmna atuuh leh, Ka melmate tungah phuba kala dinga, Ahing mudate ka thuh kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka thaltangte sisan ka dawnkham sah dinga, ka namsau in sa aval ding hi; a kithatte leh salte sisan toh, melma lamkaite lu a kipat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Aw nou nam chinte aw, amite toh kipah un, Aman a suohte phuba ala ding hi, Ama doutute tungah phuba ala ding, Agam leh amite adingin kilemna buching abawl ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi leh Nun tapa Joshua ahing pei ua, mipite zah in tam la thute zousie agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tualeh tua thute zousie Israelte zousie kung a agen zouin, akung uah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tunia na kung ua “Ka hing thu theisahte ah na lungtanguh koi kip unlen, tam danthu zousie pilvang tah a zui ding in na tate uh thu pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tam thute nou a dingin bangmalou maimai ahisih a, na hinna uh ahi zaw hi, tualeh tam thute zieh in luo ding a Jordan lui nava galkaina gam uah na dam sawt ding uhi; achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tualeh khum ni mama in Mangpa’n Mosi ahoupi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Jeriko gal a um Moab gam a Abarim taangdunga Nebo muolvum ah kaltou inlen, Israel tate kunga aluo ding ua ka pieh Kanaan gam va gal et in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuachi’n na sanggampa Aaron Hor muol ah a shi a, achipite kunga pui ahitah mabangin, na kaltouna muolvum ah na shi dinga na chipite kunga pui na hita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Aziehpen Zin gamdai a Meribah Kadesh tuimun a Israel tate lah ah ka tungah na takhielta a, Israel tate lah a na hing pahtawilou zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Khum gam nava galmu dinga, hinanleh Israel tate kunga ka pieh gam ah na lut sih ding hi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam guolzawlnate in, Pasian mi Mosi in ashi masangin Israel tate aguolzawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama’n agen a, “Mangpa khu Sinai muol dawn ah ahing pei a, Seir akipat in atung uah ni bangin ahing suoh a, Paran muoldawna kipat ahing taanga, Mi siengthou tul sawmte toh ahing pei a, a khut zietlam apat ama ua dingin dan meikuong, bangin ahing pawtdoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi Aman amite a it a, Ami siengthoute zousie akhut sungah akem hi, ama u’khu na kengbul ah atou ua na thu apom chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mosi in dan ahing pie a, Jakob mipite gouluo dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mipi lamkaite leh Israel tate kikhop khawm laiin, ama khu Jeshurun ah leeng ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Reuben dam henlen, shi sih heh, amite zong tawm sih uheh;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh tamte khu Juda vangphatna hi hen, “Mangpa Juda aw ngaikhie inlen, amite kung ah puilut in, akhut ama a dingin kiching henlen, amelmate apat ama panpitu hiin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh “Levi tung thu ah pen, Na thumim leh, na Urim khu na misiengthoute kung ah a um a, Massah ah na ze et a, Meribah tui mun ah na kinielpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka nu leh ka pa ka thei sih chiten, a sanggamte zong athei sih a, ama tate ngel zong athei tuom sih a, na thu apom ua, na thuhunte azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jakob kung ah na vaihawm dante ahil ding ua, Israelte na danthute ahil ding uhi; Na masang ah gimnamtui akoi ding ua, Halmang kithoina na maitam tungah, alan ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa, aneilelamte uh guolzawl inlen, akhut nasepte uh pom pieh inlen; ama dou dinga kisate leh ama mudate kawng, athawdoh nawnlou nading un sat pieh in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Benjamin tung thuah hichiin agen a, “Mangpa’n a itpa khu bit tahin a kung ah, a umsah dinga, Mangpa’n sun nitum in aliekhu dinga; aliengkou tungah atuongsah ding hi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Joseph tung thu ah Aman hichiin agen hi; Van daitui manpha tahte leh leinuoi thuhpi, atuite in “Mangpa’n agam guolzawl hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nisa a piengkhie theiga manpha tahte leh, sil manpha hate a piengkhete in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nidang lai muolte a sil hoipente leh, kumtawn muolte a sil deihuoi pente toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Leitunga sil mantamte leh abukimna toh, sawlbawh a umpa deisahnain, guolzawlna khu Josephte lutungah leh, asanggamte apat khentuom a umpa jangsip ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thupina khu bawngtal pieng masa thupina bang ahi a; aki gam bawngtal kibang ahi, tuamin nam zousie, kawlmong dongin anotdoh dinga, Ephraimte tul sawm ahi ua, Manasete tul te ahi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Jebulunte tungthu ah hichiin agen hi, “Jebulun na vahdohnate ah kipah inlen, tualeh Issakar na puoninnte ah lungmuongin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaun muol tungah mite ahan khawm ding ua, khunah dihtatna kithoinate a lan ding uhi, amaun tuipi hausatna leh pieunel a, kiphuol gou manphate ane ding uhi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gad tungthu ah pen, “Gad sulientu khu guolzawl in um hen, Humpibahnei bangin a kuola, akhut leh a jangsipte a eehmal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aman tan hoipen akilah a, Aziehpen vaihawmpa tanvou ama din akikhet a, Mipi lamkaite toh ahing pei a, Mangpa vaihawmna dih, Israelte vaihawmnate a zui hi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dan tung thu ah pen, “Dan khu humpibahnei nou ahia, Bashan muol a kipat hing dingdoh ahi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Naphtali tungthu ah hichiin agen hi; “Aw Naphtali deisahna leh, Mangpa vaihawmna leh guolzawlna adim, tumlam leh simlam luoin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asher tungthu ah agen a, “Asher pen tate ah guolzawl in um hen, Asanggamte pom thei hi henlen, tualeh a sathau uah akengte die uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na kedap khu sia leh sum-eng ahi dinga, Na damsung nite bangin na hatna zong a um ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Jeshurun Pasian bang koima a umsih, Nang hing panpi dinga vantunga tuonga, A thupina a vanlaizawl a toupa khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumtawn Pasian khu na kihumbitna ahia, nuoilam ah kumtawn ban in ahing dom dinga, Na masanga kipat in na melmate adel mang dinga, sumangin achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel khu galmuongin a um dinga, Jakob tuinah khu bu leh uoin pienna gam ahidinga, Vanten zong daitui chiim ahing kesah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na hampha hi Aw Israel, Nangbang koi a um ei, Aw nang ahing panpina phaw leh, na thupina namsau! Mangpa hundam mite, Na melmate khu na masangah ahing kipelut ding ua. Tualeh nangman amun sangte uh, na totchil piehta ding hi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mosi khu Moab phaijang a kipat in Jeriko gal a Nebo taanga Pisgah muolvum ah akaltou a. Tualeh Mangpa’n Gelead gam zousie Dan gam dongin a en sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Naphtali gam zousie leh Ephraim leh Manaseh leh Juda gam pumpi tumlam tuipi dongin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Simlam gam leh Tumsing khopi Jeriko phaijang Zoar dongin aensah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n akungah “Tam gam khu ahi Abraham, Isaak leh Jakob te kunga, nahah nasuonte kung ah ka pe ding hi chia ka chiemna gam khu ahi; tam gam na mit in ka hing musah ta hi, hinanleh tua gam ah na lut sih ding hi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa suohpa Mosi khu Mangpa thu bangin Moab gam ah ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Beth-peor gal a Moab phaihawm khat ah avui ua, hinanleh ahan pen tunitan in koiman athei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi ashi in kum za leh sawmni a upa ahia, amit amiel sih a, atha zong akiem sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten Mosi khu Moab phaijang ah ni sawmthum sung a suun uhi, tuachi’n Mosi suunna leh kaana nite ahing beita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Nun tapa Joshua khu pilna hagau in adim a, Mosi in atunga akhut akoi tah ziehin; tualeh Israel taten athu azui ua, Mangpa’n thu apieh bangin abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh khum zou langkalsie, Mangpa’n kimaituo a ahoupi Mosi bang guolnei a um nawn mawngmawng tasih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chiemtena zousie leh sil lamdang zousie, Pharaoh leh asuohte zousie kung leh Izipt gam zousie a ensah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A khut hattah leh zauhuoi pipi a, Israelte zousie mitmu a, Mosi in abawl banga bawl koima a um nawn sih hi.
  </para>
</usx>
